{"id":"i-travel-09","lv":2,"theme":"travel","q":"Excuse me, could you tell me how to get to the station?","qja":"すみません、駅への行き方を教えていただけますか?","hint":"まっすぐ行って、2つ目の角を左","model":"Sure. Go straight and turn left at the second corner.","alts":["Go straight ahead, then take a left at the second corner.","Just go straight and turn left at the second intersection."],"keys":[["straight"],["left"],["second"]],"loose":["go","straight","turn*","left","right","corner","block*","walk*","station","minutes","there","take"],"opts":{"o":["Sure. Go straight and turn left at the second corner.","Sure. Go straight and turn to left at two corner.","Sure. You go straightly and left turn at the second corner."],"a":0},"para":["Head straight and take the second left.","Keep going straight, then left at the second corner."],"tip":"道案内は命令形 (Go ... / Turn ...) で言うのがふつうで、失礼になりません。"},
{"id":"i-travel-10","lv":2,"theme":"travel","q":"Are you traveling for work or pleasure?","qja":"お仕事での旅行ですか、それとも観光ですか?","hint":"仕事。でも週末は観光する予定","model":"It's for work, but I'm planning to do some sightseeing on the weekend.","alts":["Work, but I'll go sightseeing over the weekend.","I'm here on business, but I plan to look around on the weekend."],"keys":[["work","business"],["weekend"]],"loose":["work","business","pleasure","vacation","both","trip","sightseeing","weekend","plan*","conference","meeting*","holiday"],"opts":{"o":["It's for work, but I'm planning sightseeing at weekend.","For work, but I will planning to sightsee in the weekend.","It's for work, but I'm planning to do some sightseeing on the weekend."],"a":2},"para":["A bit of both. Work first, then some sightseeing.","Mainly work, but I've got the weekend free."],"tip":"I'm planning to + 動詞 で「〜するつもりです」と予定を伝えます。"},
{"id":"i-travel-11","lv":3,"theme":"travel","q":"What's the best trip you've ever taken?","qja":"今までで一番よかった旅行は何ですか?","hint":"北海道の一人旅。景色がすばらしく、地元の人が親切だった","model":"My solo trip to Hokkaido, because the scenery was amazing and the locals were very kind.","alts":["I'd say traveling alone in Hokkaido. The views were stunning, and people were so kind.","The best one was a solo trip to Hokkaido, where the scenery was beautiful and the locals were friendly."],"keys":[["hokkaido"],["alone","solo","by myself","on my own"],["scenery","view*","landscape*","nature"]],"loose":["best","trip","went","ever","because","beautiful","amazing","people","food","scenery","traveled","traveling","visited"],"opts":{"o":["My alone trip to Hokkaido, because the sceneries were amazing and the locals were kind.","My solo trip to Hokkaido, because the scenery was amazing and the locals were very kind.","The best trip I've ever taken is to Hokkaido by alone, scenery was amazing."],"a":1},"para":["Hands down, traveling solo around Hokkaido.","A solo trip to Hokkaido. Gorgeous views and really warm people."],"tip":"scenery は数えられない名詞なので sceneries とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-travel-12","lv":3,"theme":"travel","q":"I'm afraid your flight has been canceled. What would you like to do?","qja":"申し訳ありませんが、お客様の便は欠航になりました。いかがなさいますか?","hint":"今日中の別の便に振り替えてほしい","model":"Could you put me on another flight that leaves today, if possible?","alts":["I'd like to be rebooked on another flight today, please.","Is there another flight I can take today?"],"keys":[["another flight","next flight","other flight","rebook*","different flight","another one","later flight","anything else"],["today","tonight"]],"loose":["another","flight","today","rebook*","next","could","hotel","refund","possible","tomorrow","would","change"],"opts":{"o":["Could you put me on another flight that leaves today, if possible?","Could you change me to another flight which leave today, if possible?","Please put me another flight today if it is possible to."],"a":0},"para":["Can you get me on another flight today?","If there's anything else leaving today, I'll take it."],"tip":"put me on another flight は「別の便に乗せる (振り替える)」という空港でよく使う言い方です。"},
{"id":"i-travel-13","lv":3,"theme":"travel","q":"If you had a week off, would you go abroad or travel locally?","qja":"1週間休みがあったら、海外に行きますか、それとも国内を旅行しますか?","hint":"国内。移動が楽で、まだ知らない場所が多いから","model":"I'd travel locally, because getting around is easier and there are many places I haven't seen yet.","alts":["Locally. It's easier to get around, and there's still a lot of my own country I haven't seen.","I'd stay in Japan since traveling is easier and I still have lots of places to explore."],"keys":[["locally","local","in japan","my own country","domestic*","closer to home"],["easier","easy","convenient"]],"loose":["would","abroad","locally","local","travel*","because","since","overseas","country","easier","expensive","places"],"opts":{"o":["I would travel locally, because get around is easier and there are many places I didn't see yet.","I'll go domestic, because moving is easy and many places I don't see.","I'd travel locally, because getting around is easier and there are many places I haven't seen yet."],"a":2},"para":["Somewhere local. There's so much I haven't explored.","I'd stay closer to home. It's easier, and there's plenty left to see."],"tip":"「まだ〜していない」は現在完了 I haven't seen yet で表します。"},
{"id":"i-travel-14","lv":3,"theme":"travel","q":"Have you ever had a problem while traveling?","qja":"旅行中に困ったことはありますか?","hint":"空港で荷物がなくなったが、翌日ホテルに届いた","model":"Yes, the airline lost my luggage once, but it was delivered to my hotel the next day.","alts":["Once my suitcase got lost at the airport, but they brought it to my hotel the following day.","My bag went missing at the airport, though it arrived at my hotel the next day."],"keys":[["luggage","suitcase","bag*","baggage"],["lost","missing"],["next day","following day","day after"]],"loose":["once","yes","lost","missed","problem","airport","luggage","bag*","stolen","sick","delayed","ever","time"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, the airline lost my luggages once, but it delivered to my hotel next day.","Yes, the airline lost my luggage once, but it was delivered to my hotel the next day.","Yes, my baggage was losing once, but it came my hotel the next day."],"a":1},"para":["The airline lost my bag once, but I got it back the next day.","My suitcase went missing, but it turned up at my hotel the following day."],"tip":"luggage は数えられない名詞です。また「届けられた」は受け身 was delivered にします。"},
{"id":"i-travel-15","lv":4,"theme":"travel","q":"Do you think traveling alone is better than traveling with others?","qja":"一人旅は誰かと一緒の旅行よりいいと思いますか?","hint":"どちらとも言える。一人は自由だが、誰かと行くと思い出を共有できる","model":"It depends, because traveling alone gives you freedom, while traveling with others lets you share memories.","alts":["Not necessarily. Going solo gives you more freedom, but with friends you can share the memories.","Both have good points: alone you're free, and with others you share the experience."],"keys":[["free*"],["share*","sharing"]],"loose":["depend*","alone","others","friends","freedom","free","share","because","while","although","prefer*","better","both"],"opts":{"o":["It depends, because traveling alone gives you freedom, while traveling with others lets you share memories.","It depends, because traveling alone gives you free, while traveling with others let you share memories.","It is depending, alone travel is freedom, but with others you can sharing memories."],"a":0},"para":["Each has its perks: freedom when you're alone, shared memories when you're not.","I like both. Solo trips are freeing, but sharing the moments is special too."],"tip":"while は「〜する一方で」と2つを対比するときに使えます。"},
{"id":"i-travel-16","lv":4,"theme":"travel","q":"What advice would you give someone visiting Japan for the first time?","qja":"初めて日本を訪れる人にどんなアドバイスをしますか?","hint":"現金を少し持っておくこと、そして電車の中では静かにすること","model":"I'd suggest carrying some cash and keeping quiet on trains, since some places don't take cards.","alts":["Carry a little cash, and try to stay quiet on the train.","Bring some cash with you, and remember to be quiet on trains."],"keys":[["cash"],["quiet","quietly","silent","voice down","keep it down"],["train*"]],"loose":["should","suggest*","recommend*","bring","cash","train*","try","learn","polite","quiet","rules","would","careful"],"opts":{"o":["I'd suggest to carry some cash and keep quiet in trains, since some places don't take card.","I suggest you carrying cash and be quietly on trains, because some places not take cards.","I'd suggest carrying some cash and keeping quiet on trains, since some places don't take cards."],"a":2},"para":["Have some cash on you, and keep your voice down on trains.","Two things: carry cash, and stay quiet on the train."],"tip":"suggest の後ろは -ing 形 (suggest carrying) にします。suggest to do とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-business-01","lv":1,"theme":"business","q":"What do you do for a living?","qja":"お仕事は何をされていますか?","hint":"小さな会社を経営している","model":"I run a small company of my own.","alts":["I own a small business.","I manage my own small company."],"keys":[["run","own","manag*","have"],["company","business","firm"]],"loose":["i","work*","am","company","business","job","engineer","teacher","run","office","manage*","sales"],"opts":{"o":["I run a small company of my own.","I am running small company of me.","I do a small company's president work."],"a":0},"para":["I run my own small business.","I've got a small company."],"tip":"「会社を経営する」は run a company と言うのが自然です。"},
{"id":"i-business-02","lv":1,"theme":"business","q":"How's work going these days?","qja":"最近、お仕事の調子はどうですか?","hint":"忙しいけど楽しい","model":"It's busy, but I'm really enjoying it.","alts":["Pretty busy, but it's fun.","Busy, but I really like it."],"keys":[["busy","hectic","swamped"],["enjoy*","fun","like","love","good"]],"loose":["busy","good","fine","great","work","going","okay","ok","tired","enjoy*","lately","well"],"opts":{"o":["It's busy, but I'm enjoy.","Busy, but it is enjoying.","It's busy, but I'm really enjoying it."],"a":2},"para":["Busy, but in a good way.","Hectic, but I'm having fun."],"tip":"enjoy は目的語が必要です。I'm enjoying it のように it を付けます。"},
{"id":"i-business-03","lv":1,"theme":"business","q":"Are you free for a meeting tomorrow?","qja":"明日、打ち合わせの時間はありますか?","hint":"はい、午後なら大丈夫","model":"Yes, I'm free in the afternoon.","alts":["Sure, the afternoon works for me.","Yes, the afternoon is fine."],"keys":[["afternoon","after lunch"],["yes","sure","free","fine","works","okay","ok","good","available"]],"loose":["yes","sure","free","tomorrow","morning","afternoon","time","sorry","busy","works","fine","meeting"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I'm free at afternoon.","Yes, I'm free in the afternoon.","Yes, afternoon is OK for me free."],"a":1},"para":["Sure, any time after lunch works.","The afternoon's good for me."],"tip":"「午後に」は in the afternoon。at afternoon とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-business-04","lv":1,"theme":"business","q":"Could you send me the report by Friday?","qja":"金曜日までに報告書を送ってもらえますか?","hint":"はい、木曜日までに送る","model":"Sure, I'll send it to you by Thursday.","alts":["No problem. You'll have it by Thursday.","Of course, I'll get it to you by Thursday."],"keys":[["thursday"],["send","have it","get it","email"]],"loose":["sure","send","will","friday","thursday","report","no","problem","course","by","can","try"],"opts":{"o":["Sure, I'll send it to you by Thursday.","Sure, I'll send it until Thursday.","Sure, I send you it by Thursday."],"a":0},"para":["Sure thing. You'll get it Thursday.","No problem, I'll have it to you by Thursday."],"tip":"「〜までに(期限)」は by。until は「〜までずっと」なので使い分けます。"},
{"id":"i-business-05","lv":1,"theme":"business","q":"How many people work at your company?","qja":"あなたの会社には何人くらい働いていますか?","hint":"10人くらい","model":"About ten people work at my company.","alts":["There are around ten people.","We have about ten employees."],"keys":[["ten"],["about","around","roughly","approximately","or so","maybe","almost","nearly"]],"loose":["about","around","people","employees","we","have","there","work","company","staff","small","hundred"],"opts":{"o":["About ten peoples work in my company.","There is about ten people working.","About ten people work at my company."],"a":2},"para":["Just ten or so.","We're a small team of about ten."],"tip":"people はすでに複数の意味なので peoples にはしません。"},
{"id":"i-business-06","lv":2,"theme":"business","q":"What do you like most about your job?","qja":"お仕事で一番好きなところは何ですか?","hint":"いろいろな人と出会えること","model":"I like meeting all kinds of different people.","alts":["Getting to meet lots of different people.","The best part is meeting many kinds of people."],"keys":[["meet*"],["people"]],"loose":["like","enjoy*","most","best","part","people","freedom","team","creative","learn*","because","work*"],"opts":{"o":["I like to meeting many kind of people.","I like meeting all kinds of different people.","The most I like is meet various people."],"a":1},"para":["Meeting all sorts of people.","I get to meet so many interesting people."],"tip":"The best part is ... は「一番いいところは〜」と言うのに便利です。"},
{"id":"i-business-07","lv":2,"theme":"business","q":"Can you tell me a little about your role?","qja":"あなたの役割について少し教えてもらえますか?","hint":"営業チームのリーダーで、新しい顧客を担当している","model":"I lead the sales team and handle new clients.","alts":["I'm the sales team leader, and I take care of new customers.","I manage the sales team and look after new clients."],"keys":[["sales"],["lead*","manag*","head","in charge"],["client*","customer*","account*"]],"loose":["i","am","manage*","lead*","team","responsible","handle*","work","project*","client*","charge","role"],"opts":{"o":["I'm leader of sales team and charge new clients.","I lead the sales team and handling new client.","I lead the sales team and handle new clients."],"a":2},"para":["I head up sales and look after our new clients.","I'm in charge of the sales team and new accounts."],"tip":"「担当する」は handle や take care of、look after などで言えます。"},
{"id":"i-business-08","lv":2,"theme":"business","q":"How do you usually prepare for a presentation?","qja":"プレゼンの準備はいつもどうしていますか?","hint":"何度も声に出して練習する","model":"I usually practice it out loud several times.","alts":["I rehearse it out loud many times.","I practice saying it aloud again and again."],"keys":[["practic*","rehears*","run through","go over","go through"],["out loud","aloud","say*","speak*"]],"loose":["usually","practice*","prepare*","slides","notes","rehearse*","check*","research","time*","before","write"],"opts":{"o":["I usually practice it out loud several times.","I usually practice it by big voice many time.","I usually am practicing loud several times."],"a":0},"para":["I run through it out loud a few times.","Lots of rehearsing out loud."],"tip":"「声に出して」は out loud または aloud です。"},
{"id":"i-business-09","lv":2,"theme":"business","q":"The client wants to move the meeting. What should we tell them?","qja":"取引先が打ち合わせの日程を変えたいそうです。何と伝えましょうか?","hint":"来週の火曜日なら大丈夫と伝える","model":"Let's tell them next Tuesday works for us.","alts":["We can say we're available next Tuesday.","Tell them next Tuesday is fine with us."],"keys":[["tuesday"],["next"]],"loose":["tell","let*","say","ask","them","next","week","available","okay","fine","works","could"],"opts":{"o":["Let's tell them the next Tuesday is OK to us.","Let's tell them next Tuesday works for us.","Let's say them next Tuesday is fine."],"a":1},"para":["Just say we're good for next Tuesday.","Let them know Tuesday next week is fine."],"tip":"「〜で都合がいい」は ... works for us と言うと自然です。"},
{"id":"i-business-10","lv":2,"theme":"business","q":"What's the hardest part of working remotely?","qja":"リモートワークで一番大変なことは何ですか?","hint":"チームとの気軽な会話が減ること","model":"It's hard because there's less casual chat with my team.","alts":["I miss the small talk with my coworkers.","Having fewer casual conversations with the team."],"keys":[["chat*","talk*","conversation*"],["team","coworker*","colleague*"]],"loose":["hard*","lonely","communication","team","home","focus*","miss*","less","fewer","meeting*","talk*","because"],"opts":{"o":["It's hard because casual chat with my team becomes few.","It is hard that I have less casual chats to my team.","It's hard because there's less casual chat with my team."],"a":2},"para":["I miss chatting with my team.","Not having those quick, casual chats."],"tip":"数えられない chat には less、数えられる conversations には fewer を使います。"},
{"id":"i-business-11","lv":3,"theme":"business","q":"How do you handle tight deadlines?","qja":"厳しい締め切りにはどう対応していますか?","hint":"優先順位をつけて、必要なら早めに助けを求める","model":"I prioritize the most important tasks and ask for help early if I need to.","alts":["I set priorities first, and if necessary, I ask for help early.","I focus on what matters most, and I don't hesitate to ask for help early."],"keys":[["priorit*","most important","what matters","matters most","important","first"],["help"]],"loose":["priorit*","focus*","plan*","list","task*","help","early","time","deadline*","stay*","calm","overtime","because"],"opts":{"o":["I prioritize the most important tasks and ask for help early if I need to.","I prioritize the most important tasks and ask help early if I need.","I am prioritize important tasks and asking for help early if need."],"a":0},"para":["I tackle the big stuff first and ask for help sooner rather than later.","Prioritize, and don't be shy about asking for help."],"tip":"「助けを求める」は ask for help。for を忘れないようにしましょう。"},
{"id":"i-business-12","lv":3,"theme":"business","q":"We're thinking of changing suppliers. What's your opinion?","qja":"仕入れ先を変えようかと考えています。あなたの意見は?","hint":"賛成。ただし、まず小さく試すべき","model":"I think it's a good idea, but we should test them on a small order first.","alts":["I'm for it, although we should start with a small trial first.","Sounds good, but let's start with a small order to test them."],"keys":[["good idea","great idea","for it","sounds good","agree","support","on board","makes sense"],["small"],["first","start","trial","test*","before"]],"loose":["think","agree*","idea","but","should","first","cost*","quality","risk*","price*","although","test*","trial"],"opts":{"o":["I think it's good idea, but we should testing them with small order at first.","I agree it, but we must try small order first.","I think it's a good idea, but we should test them on a small order first."],"a":2},"para":["Good idea, but let's try a small order before we commit.","I'm on board. Just test them small first."],"tip":"賛成しつつ条件を付けるときは I think it's a good idea, but ... が便利です。"},
{"id":"i-business-13","lv":3,"theme":"business","q":"Have you ever had a disagreement with a coworker? How did you solve it?","qja":"同僚と意見が対立したことはありますか?どう解決しましたか?","hint":"ある。お互いの意見を聞いて、中間案を見つけた","model":"Yes, once. We listened to each other's ideas and found a compromise.","alts":["Yes, we talked it through and found a middle ground.","I have. We heard each other out and agreed on a compromise."],"keys":[["compromise","middle ground","in between","halfway"],["listen*","talk*","discuss*","heard","hear"]],"loose":["yes","once","talked","listened","discuss*","agree*","compromise","solution","solved","understand*","calm*","meeting"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, once. We listened to each other's ideas and found a compromise.","Yes, once. We listened each other's ideas and found compromise.","Yes, one time. We were listening our opinions and find a middle."],"a":0},"para":["Sure. We talked it out and met halfway.","Once. We heard each other out and found a middle ground."],"tip":"listen は listen to + 人/もの の形で使います。"},
{"id":"i-business-14","lv":3,"theme":"business","q":"What would you do if a client complained about a late delivery?","qja":"取引先から納品の遅れについて苦情が来たら、どうしますか?","hint":"まず謝って、理由を説明し、割引を提案する","model":"I'd apologize first, explain the reason for the delay, and offer a discount.","alts":["First, I'd say sorry, explain what happened, and offer them a discount.","I'd apologize, explain why it was late, and suggest a discount."],"keys":[["apologi*","sorry"],["discount"]],"loose":["apologi*","sorry","explain*","offer*","discount","would","first","reason","delay","refund","call*","solution"],"opts":{"o":["I'd apologize first, explain them the reason of the delay, and offer discount.","I'd apologize first, explain the reason for the delay, and offer a discount.","I will apologize to first, explaining the reason, and give them discounting."],"a":1},"para":["Apologize, explain what went wrong, and offer something to make up for it.","Say sorry, give them the reason, and offer a discount."],"tip":"explain は explain + 物事 (to 人) の順です。explain them ... とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-business-15","lv":4,"theme":"business","q":"Some say face-to-face meetings are a waste of time. Do you agree?","qja":"対面の会議は時間の無駄だと言う人がいます。同意しますか?","hint":"完全には同意しない。オンラインは便利だが、信頼関係は対面のほうが作りやすい","model":"I don't fully agree, because although online is convenient, it's easier to build trust face to face.","alts":["Not entirely. Online meetings are handy, but trust is easier to build in person.","I partly disagree, since you can build trust more easily when you meet in person, even if online is convenient."],"keys":[["not","disagree"],["trust","relationship*"],["face to face","in person"]],"loose":["agree*","disagree*","think","because","although","however","online","meetings","trust","person","time","depend*","efficient"],"opts":{"o":["I don't fully agree, because although online is convenient, it's easier to build trust face to face.","I don't agree fully, because online is convenient, but trust is easy to make by face.","I'm not fully agree, although online is convenient, building trust is easier in face to face."],"a":0},"para":["Not completely. Online is handy, but trust is built in person.","I'd push back a little. Some things just work better face to face."],"tip":"I don't fully agree は、やわらかく反対するときの言い方です。"},
{"id":"i-business-16","lv":4,"theme":"business","q":"If you could change one thing about your industry, what would it be?","qja":"もしあなたの業界で1つ変えられるとしたら、何を変えますか?","hint":"長時間労働をなくして、もっと柔軟に働けるようにしたい","model":"I'd get rid of long working hours so that people could work more flexibly.","alts":["I'd end the long hours and let people work more flexibly.","I'd like to reduce overtime and make work schedules more flexible."],"keys":[["long hours","long working hours","overtime"],["flexib*"]],"loose":["would","change*","industry","because","people","work*","more","less","hours","pay","technology","culture","if"],"opts":{"o":["I'd get rid of long work hours so that people can working more flexible.","I would remove long working hour for people work flexibly more.","I'd get rid of long working hours so that people could work more flexibly."],"a":2},"para":["Less overtime and more flexible schedules.","I'd kill the long-hours culture and let people work flexibly."],"tip":"so that + 主語 + could ... で「〜できるように」と目的を表します。"},
{"id":"i-fx-01","lv":1,"theme":"fx","q":"How long have you been trading?","qja":"トレードを始めてどのくらいになりますか?","hint":"だいたい5年","model":"I've been trading for about five years.","alts":["About five years now.","For around five years."],"keys":[["five"],["year*"]],"loose":["been","trading","for","years","months","about","since","started","just","long"],"opts":{"o":["I've been trading for about five years.","I'm trading since five years.","I have been trade for about five years."],"a":0},"para":["Around five years now.","Five years or so."],"tip":"「ずっと〜している」は現在完了進行形 I've been trading for ... で言います。"},
{"id":"i-fx-02","lv":1,"theme":"fx","q":"Which currency pair do you trade the most?","qja":"一番よく取引する通貨ペアはどれですか?","hint":"ポンド円","model":"I trade pound-yen the most.","alts":["Mostly pound yen.","Pound-yen, by far."],"keys":[["pound","gbp","sterling"],["yen","jpy"]],"loose":["mostly","most","trade*","pound","yen","dollar","euro","pair","usually","gbp","usd","eur","jpy"],"opts":{"o":["I trade most the pound yen.","I trade pound-yen the most.","The pound yen is the most trading."],"a":1},"para":["Pound-yen, for the most part.","Mostly GBP/JPY."],"tip":"「一番よく〜する」は文末に the most を置きます (trade ... the most)。"},
{"id":"i-fx-03","lv":1,"theme":"fx","q":"What time of day do you usually trade?","qja":"1日のうち、たいていいつトレードしますか?","hint":"夜、仕事が終わってから","model":"I usually trade at night after work.","alts":["Mostly in the evening, after work.","At night, once I finish work."],"keys":[["night","evening"],["after work","finish* work","off work","after my job","after my day job","work is done","done with work","get home"]],"loose":["usually","night","morning","evening","after","work","trade*","london","session","open","time"],"opts":{"o":["I usually trade in night after the work.","I usually trading at night after work.","I usually trade at night after work."],"a":2},"para":["Evenings, once work's done.","Mostly at night after my day job."],"tip":"「夜に」は at night、「夕方に」は in the evening と前置詞が違います。"},
{"id":"i-fx-04","lv":1,"theme":"fx","q":"Do you use a chart app on your phone?","qja":"スマホでチャートアプリを使っていますか?","hint":"はい、毎日使っている","model":"Yes, I use one every day.","alts":["Yes, I check it every day.","I do. I use it daily."],"keys":[["yes","yeah","yep","i do"],["every day","every single day","daily","all the time"]],"loose":["yes","no","use*","every","day","daily","phone","app","computer","pc","chart*","check*"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I use one every day.","Yes, I use it everyday days.","Yes, I am using every day it."],"a":0},"para":["Yep, every single day.","All the time."],"tip":"「毎日」は副詞として every day と2語で書きます。"},
{"id":"i-fx-05","lv":1,"theme":"fx","q":"How did you get into trading?","qja":"どうやってトレードを始めたのですか?","hint":"友だちにすすめられた","model":"A friend recommended it to me.","alts":["My friend got me into it.","A friend told me to try it."],"keys":[["friend*"],["recommend*","got me into","told me","introduced","suggest*","talked me into","got me started"]],"loose":["friend*","book*","started","video*","interested","read","because","learn*","work","money"],"opts":{"o":["A friend recommended me it.","My friend was recommending to me trading.","A friend recommended it to me."],"a":2},"para":["A friend talked me into it.","It started with a friend's recommendation."],"tip":"recommend は recommend + もの + to 人 の語順です。"},
{"id":"i-fx-06","lv":2,"theme":"fx","q":"How do you decide when to enter a trade?","qja":"エントリーのタイミングはどうやって決めていますか?","hint":"長い時間足で流れを見てから、短い時間足でタイミングを取る","model":"I check the trend on a longer chart, then time my entry on a shorter one.","alts":["First I look at the bigger trend, then I use a shorter chart to time my entry.","I use the higher time frame for direction and the lower one for timing."],"keys":[["trend","direction","bigger picture","big picture","higher","longer"],["short*","lower","smaller","zoom in"]],"loose":["trend","chart*","time","frame*","enter","entry","wait*","signal*","support","resistance","when","break*"],"opts":{"o":["I check the trend in longer time frame, then timing entry on shorter one.","I check the trend on a longer chart, then time my entry on a shorter one.","I'm checking long time trend, then shorter entry time."],"a":1},"para":["Big picture first, then I zoom in to time the entry.","Higher time frame for the trend, lower one for the trigger."],"tip":"time は動詞で「タイミングを計る」の意味にもなります (time my entry)。"},
{"id":"i-fx-07","lv":2,"theme":"fx","q":"Do you always use a stop-loss?","qja":"いつも損切り注文を入れていますか?","hint":"はい、必ず。大きな損失を防ぐため","model":"Yes, always, so I don't take a big loss.","alts":["Always. It protects me from big losses.","Yes, every time, to avoid large losses."],"keys":[["always","every time","every trade","yes"],["loss*","lose","losing"]],"loose":["yes","always","stop","loss*","every","protect*","risk","never","sometimes","because","set"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, always, so I don't take a big loss.","Yes, always, for not taking big loss.","Yes, always, so I am not lose big."],"a":0},"para":["Every single trade. It keeps losses small.","Always. No exceptions."],"tip":"so (that) I don't ... で「〜しないように」と目的を言えます。"},
{"id":"i-fx-08","lv":2,"theme":"fx","q":"What's the biggest mistake you made as a beginner?","qja":"初心者のころの一番大きな失敗は何ですか?","hint":"負けを取り返そうとして取引しすぎたこと","model":"I traded too much because I wanted to win back my losses.","alts":["Overtrading to get my losses back.","I made too many trades trying to recover my losses."],"keys":[["too much","too many","overtrad*","too often"],["loss*","back","recover*"]],"loose":["mistake","traded","too","much","many","loss*","risk","stop","emotion*","greedy","didnt","did","because","lot"],"opts":{"o":["I traded too many because I wanted to win back my loss.","I was trading so much because I want win back losses.","I traded too much because I wanted to win back my losses."],"a":2},"para":["Revenge trading after a loss.","I overtraded, trying to make it all back."],"tip":"too much (量) と too many (数) を区別します。trade too much で「取引しすぎ」です。"},
{"id":"i-fx-09","lv":2,"theme":"fx","q":"Do you keep a trading journal?","qja":"トレード日誌をつけていますか?","hint":"はい、毎回スクリーンショットを保存している","model":"Yes, I save a screenshot of every trade.","alts":["I do. I keep screenshots of each trade.","Yes, I take a screenshot every time I trade."],"keys":[["screenshot*","screen shot*","picture*"],["every","each","all"]],"loose":["yes","no","journal","write*","record*","every","trade*","notes","screenshot*","keep","review*","should"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I save screenshot of every trades.","Yes, I save a screenshot of every trade.","Yes, I am saving screenshots each trades."],"a":1},"para":["Yep, screenshots of every single trade.","I screenshot all my trades."],"tip":"every の後ろの名詞は単数形 (every trade) です。"},
{"id":"i-fx-10","lv":2,"theme":"fx","q":"How do you stay calm when a trade goes against you?","qja":"ポジションが逆行したとき、どうやって冷静さを保っていますか?","hint":"チャートから離れて、最初に決めたルールを信じる","model":"I step away from the chart and trust the rules I set beforehand.","alts":["I leave the screen and stick to the rules I decided on.","I take a break from the chart and follow my plan."],"keys":[["away","leave","break","close"],["rule*","plan"]],"loose":["calm","rules","plan","stop","loss","breath*","walk","away","trust","stick","accept*","break","follow*"],"opts":{"o":["I step away from the chart and trust the rules I set beforehand.","I step away the chart and believe the rules I made before.","I am leaving from the chart and trusting rules I set in beginning."],"a":0},"para":["I walk away from the screen and let my plan do its job.","Close the chart, trust the plan."],"tip":"step away from ... は「〜から(いったん)離れる」の意味です。from を忘れずに。"},
{"id":"i-fx-11","lv":3,"theme":"fx","q":"What's the most important lesson trading has taught you?","qja":"トレードから学んだ一番大切な教訓は何ですか?","hint":"忍耐。よいチャンスを待つことが大事","model":"It's taught me patience, because waiting for good setups matters more than trading often.","alts":["Patience. Waiting for the right setup is more important than trading a lot.","I've learned to be patient and wait for good opportunities."],"keys":[["patien*"],["wait*"]],"loose":["learned","taught","patience","patient","discipline","risk","because","emotion*","important","wait*","losses","rules"],"opts":{"o":["It's taught me patience, because wait for good setups is more matter than trading often.","It teaches me the patience, waiting good setup is important.","It's taught me patience, because waiting for good setups matters more than trading often."],"a":2},"para":["Patience, hands down. The good trades come to those who wait.","To be patient and wait for the right moment."],"tip":"「〜を教えてくれた」は現在完了 It's taught me ... (= It has taught me) で言えます。"},
{"id":"i-fx-12","lv":3,"theme":"fx","q":"If a beginner asked you how to start trading, what would you tell them?","qja":"初心者にトレードの始め方を聞かれたら、何と言いますか?","hint":"まずデモ口座で練習して、失ってもいい少額から始める","model":"I'd tell them to practice on a demo account first and start with money they can afford to lose.","alts":["Start with a demo account, then use only a small amount you can afford to lose.","Practice with a demo first, and only risk money you're okay with losing."],"keys":[["demo"],["small","afford","okay with losing","ok with losing","can lose"]],"loose":["would","tell","start*","demo","small","practice","learn","risk","money","first","study","lose","should"],"opts":{"o":["I'd tell them to practice on a demo account first and start with money they can afford to lose.","I'd tell them practicing on a demo account first and start with money they can lose it.","I would say to them, practice demo account and starting small money."],"a":0},"para":["Demo first, then small money you won't miss.","Practice on demo, and never risk more than you can lose."],"tip":"tell + 人 + to 動詞 で「人に〜するように言う」です。"},
{"id":"i-fx-13","lv":3,"theme":"fx","q":"Do you think trading can be a full-time job?","qja":"トレードは本業になりうると思いますか?","hint":"なりうるが、安定するまでは収入源を別に持つべき","model":"It can be, but I think you should have another income until your results are stable.","alts":["It's possible, but you should keep another source of income until you're consistent.","Yes, although it's wise to keep a separate income until your results become stable."],"keys":[["can","possible","yes"],["income","job","salary"],["stable","consistent","steady"]],"loose":["think","can","possible","but","because","job","income","risk*","difficult","hard","stable","although","full"],"opts":{"o":["It can be, but I think you should have another income until your results will be stable.","It can be, but I think you should have another income until your results are stable.","It can, but you should having other income until results become stable."],"a":1},"para":["Sure, but keep a day job until you're consistently profitable.","It can, but don't quit your job too soon."],"tip":"until の後ろは未来のことでも現在形 (until your results are stable) にします。"},
{"id":"i-fx-14","lv":3,"theme":"fx","q":"How do economic news releases affect the way you trade?","qja":"経済指標の発表はあなたのトレードにどう影響しますか?","hint":"大きな発表の前後は値動きが荒いので取引しない","model":"I avoid trading around big announcements because the price can move wildly.","alts":["I stay out of the market before and after major news, since prices get really volatile.","I don't trade around big releases because the market gets too volatile."],"keys":[["avoid","stay out","stay away","sit out","step back","do not trade","not trade","stop trading","no trading"],["volatil*","wild*","jump*","sharp*","mov*","crazy","unpredictable"]],"loose":["news","avoid*","before","after","volatile","volatility","because","careful","price*","market","announcement*","wait*","release*"],"opts":{"o":["I avoid to trade around big announcements because price can move wild.","I am not trading around big news, the price can moving wildly.","I avoid trading around big announcements because the price can move wildly."],"a":2},"para":["I just sit out big news. It's too wild.","I step back around major releases."],"tip":"avoid の後ろは -ing 形です (avoid trading)。"},
{"id":"i-fx-15","lv":4,"theme":"fx","q":"Some people say trading is just gambling. How would you respond?","qja":"トレードはただのギャンブルだと言う人もいます。どう答えますか?","hint":"ルールとリスク管理がなければそうかもしれないが、計画があれば違う","model":"Without rules and risk management it might be, but with a clear plan, it's a completely different thing.","alts":["It could be if you have no rules, but with proper risk management and a plan, it's not gambling.","I'd say it's only gambling when you trade without a plan or risk control."],"keys":[["rule*","plan"],["risk"]],"loose":["gambling","rules","risk","plan","without","with","management","but","if","because","disagree*","think","discipline"],"opts":{"o":["Without rules and risk management it might be, but with a clear plan, it's a completely different thing.","Without rules and risk management it might, but with clear plan, it is complete different thing.","If no rules and risk management maybe, but if plan is clear it is different thing."],"a":0},"para":["Only if you trade without a plan.","With no rules, sure. With solid risk management, not at all."],"tip":"Without ..., it might be, but ... は相手の意見を一部認めつつ反論する形です。"},
{"id":"i-fx-16","lv":4,"theme":"fx","q":"How has your trading style changed since you started?","qja":"始めたころから、トレードスタイルはどう変わりましたか?","hint":"短期売買が多かったが、今は取引回数を減らして大きな流れに乗る","model":"I used to scalp a lot, but now I trade less often and try to follow the bigger trend.","alts":["At first I did lots of short-term trades, but these days I trade less and ride the bigger trends.","I've gone from frequent short trades to fewer trades that follow the main trend."],"keys":[["short*","scalp*","frequent"],["less","fewer"],["trend*"]],"loose":["used","now","before","more","less","fewer","changed","trend","patient","short","long","term","started","because"],"opts":{"o":["I used to scalping a lot, but now I trade less often and try following the bigger trend.","I was used to scalp much, but now my trades are less and follow big trend.","I used to scalp a lot, but now I trade less often and try to follow the bigger trend."],"a":2},"para":["I've slowed down a lot. Fewer trades, bigger moves.","Less scalping, more trend-following."],"tip":"used to + 動詞の原形 で「以前は〜していた」。used to scalping とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-01","lv":1,"theme":"stocks","q":"Do you invest in stocks?","qja":"株に投資していますか?","hint":"はい、少しだけ","model":"Yes, I invest a little in stocks.","alts":["Yes, just a little.","I do, but only a small amount."],"keys":[["yes","yeah","yep","i do"],["little","small","bit"]],"loose":["yes","no","invest*","little","stocks","some","fund*","bit","not","yet","want"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I invest few in stocks.","Yes, I invest a little in stocks.","Yes, I'm investing a little stocks."],"a":1},"para":["A little bit, yeah.","Yes, just a small amount."],"tip":"量の「少し」は a little。few は数えられる名詞に使います。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-02","lv":1,"theme":"stocks","q":"Why did you start investing?","qja":"どうして投資を始めたのですか?","hint":"老後のためにお金を増やしたかった","model":"I wanted to grow my money for retirement.","alts":["To save more for my retirement.","I wanted to build money for when I retire."],"keys":[["retire*","old age","future"],["money","sav*","grow","build"]],"loose":["wanted","want","because","money","future","retirement","save*","grow","interest*","friend","learn"],"opts":{"o":["I wanted to grow my money for retirement.","I wanted to increase my money to retirement.","I want growing my money for the retire."],"a":0},"para":["For my retirement, mainly.","To build up some savings for later in life."],"tip":"「お金を増やす」は grow my money と言えます。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-03","lv":1,"theme":"stocks","q":"How often do you check the market?","qja":"どのくらいの頻度で相場をチェックしますか?","hint":"1日に1回、朝に","model":"I check it once a day in the morning.","alts":["Once a day, every morning.","Just once a day, in the morning."],"keys":[["once","one time","every morning","each morning"],["morning"]],"loose":["once","twice","day","week","every","morning","night","check*","often","sometimes","rarely","never"],"opts":{"o":["I check it one time in a day at morning.","I am checking once a day in morning.","I check it once a day in the morning."],"a":2},"para":["Once a day, first thing in the morning.","Just a quick look every morning."],"tip":"「1日に1回」は once a day。a が「〜につき」の意味です。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-04","lv":1,"theme":"stocks","q":"Do you like long-term or short-term investing?","qja":"長期投資と短期投資、どちらが好きですか?","hint":"長期。ストレスが少ないから","model":"I like long-term investing because it's less stressful.","alts":["Long-term. It's less stressful.","I prefer the long term since it's not as stressful."],"keys":[["long"],["stress*","relax*","easy","calm"]],"loose":["long","short","term","like","prefer*","because","stress*","easy","both","safe*","time"],"opts":{"o":["I like long-term investing because it's less stressful.","I like long-term investing because it's less stressed.","I like long-term investing because it's not stressing."],"a":0},"para":["Long-term. Way less stress.","I'm a long-term person. It's easier on the nerves."],"tip":"stressful は形容詞、stress は名詞です。less stressful で「ストレスが少ない」。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-05","lv":1,"theme":"stocks","q":"What kind of companies do you invest in?","qja":"どんな会社に投資していますか?","hint":"テクノロジー系の会社","model":"I mostly invest in tech companies.","alts":["Mainly technology companies.","Mostly tech firms."],"keys":[["tech*"]],"loose":["mostly","mainly","tech*","companies","big","small","food","energy","bank*","dividend*","fund*","invest*"],"opts":{"o":["I mostly invest to tech companies.","I mostly invest in tech companies.","I am mostly investing at tech company."],"a":1},"para":["Tech, mostly.","Mainly tech names."],"tip":"「〜に投資する」は invest in ... です。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-06","lv":2,"theme":"stocks","q":"Have you ever bought shares of a company you love?","qja":"好きな会社の株を買ったことはありますか?","hint":"ある。よく使うゲーム会社の株を買った","model":"Yes, I bought shares in a game company whose games I play a lot.","alts":["Yes, I bought stock in a game company I really like.","I have. I own shares of a game maker I love."],"keys":[["game*"],["bought","own","have","buy"]],"loose":["yes","no","bought","buy","shares","stock*","company","love","favorite","use","product*","never","once"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I bought shares in a game company which games I play a lot.","Yes, I have buy shares a game company I play a lot.","Yes, I bought shares in a game company whose games I play a lot."],"a":2},"para":["Yep, a game company I'm a big fan of.","I did. I bought into a game maker I like."],"tip":"「その会社のゲーム」は whose games で、所有を表す関係代名詞 whose を使います。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-07","lv":2,"theme":"stocks","q":"How do you choose which stocks to buy?","qja":"どうやって買う銘柄を選んでいますか?","hint":"業績と、その会社の商品が好きかどうかを見る","model":"I look at their earnings and whether I like their products.","alts":["I check the company's earnings and if I like what they make.","I look at profits and whether their products are good."],"keys":[["earning*","profit*","results","sales","revenue"],["product*","what they make","service*"]],"loose":["look*","check*","earnings","profit*","research","product*","price","dividend*","growth","chart*","news","read*"],"opts":{"o":["I look at their earnings and whether I like their products.","I look their earnings and whether I like their products.","I am looking their earnings and do I like products."],"a":0},"para":["Earnings first, then whether I'd use their products.","Solid profits and products I actually like."],"tip":"whether は「〜かどうか」。whether I like ... の語順に注意します。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-08","lv":2,"theme":"stocks","q":"What do you do when the market drops sharply?","qja":"相場が急落したとき、どうしますか?","hint":"何もしない。慌てて売らない","model":"I don't do anything, and I don't panic and sell.","alts":["Nothing. I try not to panic sell.","I just hold and don't sell in a panic."],"keys":[["not","nothing","hold","sit tight"],["panic*","sell","sold","hold*","wait*","sit tight"]],"loose":["nothing","hold*","buy*","sell*","panic*","wait*","calm","more","long","term","not","dont","do"],"opts":{"o":["I don't do nothing, and I don't panic for sell.","I don't do anything, and I don't panic and sell.","I do not anything, and not panicking to sell."],"a":1},"para":["I sit tight and wait it out.","Nothing. Selling in a panic never helps."],"tip":"「何もしない」は I don't do anything。don't と nothing は一緒に使いません。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-09","lv":2,"theme":"stocks","q":"Do you prefer individual stocks or index funds?","qja":"個別株とインデックスファンド、どちらが好きですか?","hint":"インデックスファンド。手間がかからないから","model":"I prefer index funds because they don't take much time.","alts":["Index funds. They're low effort.","Index funds, since they're easy to manage."],"keys":[["index"],["time","effort","easy","simple","hassle","work","hands off"]],"loose":["prefer*","index","funds","individual","stocks","because","both","easy","risk","simple","diversif*","time"],"opts":{"o":["I prefer index funds because they don't take many time.","I am prefer index funds, it's no taking time.","I prefer index funds because they don't take much time."],"a":2},"para":["Index funds. Set it and forget it.","Index funds. Much less hassle."],"tip":"time は数えられない名詞なので much time。many time とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-10","lv":2,"theme":"stocks","q":"Do you talk about investing with your friends?","qja":"友だちと投資の話をしますか?","hint":"ときどき。でもお金の話は少しはずかしい","model":"Sometimes, but talking about money is a little embarrassing.","alts":["Now and then, but I feel a bit awkward talking about money.","Sometimes, though money is kind of an awkward topic."],"keys":[["sometimes","now and then","occasionally"],["embarrass*","awkward","shy","uncomfortable","touchy","weird"]],"loose":["sometimes","yes","no","never","friends","talk*","money","often","rarely","awkward","private","with"],"opts":{"o":["Sometimes, but talking about money is a little embarrassing.","Sometimes, but talking about money is a little embarrassed.","Sometimes, but talk about money is little shame."],"a":0},"para":["Now and then. Money talk feels a bit awkward, though.","Occasionally, but it's kind of a touchy subject."],"tip":"embarrassing は「(物事が)はずかしい」、embarrassed は「(人が)はずかしく思う」です。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-11","lv":3,"theme":"stocks","q":"What's one investing mistake you'd warn others about?","qja":"他の人に注意してほしい投資の失敗を1つ挙げるとしたら?","hint":"話題の株を調べずに買うこと","model":"I'd warn people not to buy popular stocks without doing their own research.","alts":["Buying hyped stocks without researching them first.","Don't jump into trendy stocks without looking into them yourself."],"keys":[["popular","hyped","trendy","hot","everyone"],["research*","looking into","look into","check*","study","know nothing","without knowing"]],"loose":["mistake","warn","without","research","buy*","risk","emotion*","panic","everything","one","because","popular","debt"],"opts":{"o":["I'd warn people to not buying popular stocks without doing their own research.","I warn people don't buy popular stocks without research by themselves.","I'd warn people not to buy popular stocks without doing their own research."],"a":2},"para":["Chasing hot stocks you know nothing about.","Never buy something just because everyone's talking about it."],"tip":"warn + 人 + not to 動詞 で「〜しないよう注意する」です。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-12","lv":3,"theme":"stocks","q":"If you had extra money, would you invest it or save it?","qja":"もし余分なお金があったら、投資しますか、それとも貯金しますか?","hint":"半分は投資して、半分は緊急用に取っておく","model":"I'd invest half of it and keep the other half for emergencies.","alts":["Half and half: invest some, and save the rest for emergencies.","I'd split it, investing half and saving half for emergencies."],"keys":[["half"],["emergenc*","rainy day"]],"loose":["would","invest*","save*","both","half","because","bank","emergenc*","future","depend*","spend*"],"opts":{"o":["I'd invest half of it and keep the other half for emergencies.","I'd invest half of it and keep another half for emergencies.","I will invest half and keeping the other half to emergency."],"a":0},"para":["Split it down the middle: half invested, half for emergencies.","Some of both, with an emergency cushion."],"tip":"2つのうちの「残りの半分」は the other half です。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-13","lv":3,"theme":"stocks","q":"How has investing changed the way you think about money?","qja":"投資を始めて、お金に対する考え方はどう変わりましたか?","hint":"無駄づかいが減って、長い目で考えるようになった","model":"I've started thinking long-term, so I waste much less money than before.","alts":["I think more long-term now, and I spend less on things I don't need.","It made me think in the long run, so I don't waste money as much."],"keys":[["long"],["wast*","spend less","less on","not spend","careful*"]],"loose":["think*","more","less","long","term","save*","spend*","waste*","careful","future","since","now","before","changed"],"opts":{"o":["I started to think long-term, so I waste less many money than before.","I've started thinking long-term, so I waste much less money than before.","I have started thinking long-term, so I am wasting money less than before."],"a":1},"para":["I think long-term now and spend more carefully.","I'm way less wasteful than I used to be."],"tip":"much less ... で「ずっと少ない」と比較を強調できます。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-14","lv":3,"theme":"stocks","q":"Would you recommend investing to someone in their twenties?","qja":"20代の人に投資をすすめますか?","hint":"すすめる。時間を味方にできるから。ただし少額から","model":"Yes, because time is on their side, but I'd suggest starting with small amounts.","alts":["Definitely, since they have time on their side. Just start small.","I would, because time works in their favor, but they should start small."],"keys":[["time"],["small","little"]],"loose":["yes","recommend*","because","time","early","young","small","start*","learn*","risk","should","long","compound*"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, because time is their side, but I'd suggest to start with small amounts.","Yes, time is on their side, but I suggest them starting small amount.","Yes, because time is on their side, but I'd suggest starting with small amounts."],"a":2},"para":["Absolutely. Start small and let time do the work.","For sure, just begin with a little."],"tip":"time is on your side は「時間が味方している」という慣用表現です。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-15","lv":4,"theme":"stocks","q":"Some people think investing is only for the rich. What's your view?","qja":"投資はお金持ちだけのものだと考える人もいます。あなたの考えは?","hint":"同意しない。今は少額から始められるし、早く始めるほうが大事","model":"I disagree, because nowadays you can start with a small amount, and starting early matters more than how much you have.","alts":["I don't think so. You can begin with very little these days, and starting early is what counts.","Not really. Small amounts are fine now, and time matters more than money."],"keys":[["disagree","not think so","do not agree","not really","not true"],["small","little"]],"loose":["disagree*","agree*","think","because","anyone","small","little","nowadays","rich","start*","early","everyone","money"],"opts":{"o":["I disagree, because nowadays you can start with a small amount, and starting early matters more than how much you have.","I disagree, because nowadays you can start by small amount, and start early is more matter.","I'm disagree, now you can starting with a small money, and early start is important than amount."],"a":0},"para":["Not at all. Anyone can start small these days.","I'd say it's for anyone willing to start early, even with a little."],"tip":"I disagree の前に be動詞は不要です (I'm disagree は誤り)。"},
{"id":"i-stocks-16","lv":4,"theme":"stocks","q":"What would you tell a friend who wants to invest all their savings in one stock?","qja":"貯金を全部1つの株に入れたいという友だちに、何と言いますか?","hint":"やめたほうがいい。分散しないと、その会社がだめになったとき全部失うかもしれない","model":"I'd tell them it's too risky, because if that company fails, they could lose everything, so they should diversify.","alts":["That's risky. If the company goes under, you could lose it all, so spread your money out.","I'd advise against it and suggest diversifying, since one bad company could wipe out everything."],"keys":[["risk*","advise against","bad idea","do not","dangerous"],["diversif*","spread","different"],["lose","lost","wipe out","everything","it all"]],"loose":["risky","risk","diversif*","spread","would","because","if","lose","everything","should","not","advise","dangerous"],"opts":{"o":["I'd tell them it's too risky, because if that company fail, they could lose everything, so they should diversify it.","I'd tell them it's too risky, because if that company fails, they could lose everything, so they should diversify.","I'll say it is so risk, if company fails, they lose all, so must diversify."],"a":1},"para":["Don't put all your eggs in one basket.","Spread it out. One stock is way too risky."],"tip":"Don't put all your eggs in one basket は「分散せよ」という有名なことわざです。"},
{"id":"i-tech-01","lv":1,"theme":"tech","q":"Do you use AI tools at work?","qja":"仕事でAIツールを使っていますか?","hint":"はい、毎日メールを書くのに使う","model":"Yes, I use them every day to write emails.","alts":["Yes, I use AI to write emails every day.","I do. I use them daily for emails."],"keys":[["email*","mail*"],["every day","daily","all the time"]],"loose":["yes","no","use*","ai","every","day","write*","email*","sometimes","work","translate*","research"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I use them every day to write emails.","Yes, I use them every day for write emails.","Yes, I am using them everyday to write emails."],"a":0},"para":["Every day, mostly for emails.","All the time. They help me write emails."],"tip":"to + 動詞 で「〜するために」と目的を言えます (to write emails)。"},
{"id":"i-tech-02","lv":1,"theme":"tech","q":"What apps do you use the most?","qja":"一番よく使うアプリは何ですか?","hint":"地図アプリと音楽アプリ","model":"I use map apps and music apps the most.","alts":["Mostly maps and music apps.","Map and music apps."],"keys":[["map*"],["music"]],"loose":["use*","most","apps","app","map*","music","social","media","chat","video*","news","camera","mostly"],"opts":{"o":["I use map app and music app most of all apps.","I use map apps and music apps the most.","I'm using most is maps and musics."],"a":1},"para":["Maps and music, mostly.","Probably my map and music apps."],"tip":"music は数えられない名詞なので musics とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-tech-03","lv":1,"theme":"tech","q":"How many hours a day do you spend on your phone?","qja":"1日に何時間スマホを使っていますか?","hint":"3時間くらい。多すぎると思う","model":"About three hours a day, which I think is too much.","alts":["Around three hours. That's too much, I think.","Maybe three hours a day. It's too much."],"keys":[["three"],["too much","too many","too long","a lot"]],"loose":["about","around","hours","hour","day","too","much","phone","maybe","many","less","more"],"opts":{"o":["About three hour a day, I think it is too many.","Around three hours in a day, I think so much.","About three hours a day, which I think is too much."],"a":2},"para":["Like three hours. Way too much.","Probably three hours a day, honestly too much."],"tip":"「多すぎる(量)」は too much。時間の長さにも使えます。"},
{"id":"i-tech-04","lv":1,"theme":"tech","q":"Do you like trying new gadgets?","qja":"新しいガジェットを試すのは好きですか?","hint":"はい、大好き。特にヘッドホン","model":"Yes, I love it, especially new headphones.","alts":["I really do, especially headphones.","Yes, I love new gadgets, particularly headphones."],"keys":[["love","like","yes","yeah","totally","definitely","i do","i really do"],["headphone*","earphone*","headset*"]],"loose":["yes","no","love*","like*","new","gadgets","phone*","headphones","especially","sometimes","watch*","camera"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I love it, especially new headphones.","Yes, I love it, especially new headphone.","Yes, I'm loving, special new headphones."],"a":0},"para":["Totally, especially headphones.","I'm a sucker for new headphones."],"tip":"headphones はふつう複数形で使います。"},
{"id":"i-tech-05","lv":1,"theme":"tech","q":"What do you usually ask AI chatbots?","qja":"AIチャットボットにふだん何を聞いていますか?","hint":"料理のレシピや英語の質問","model":"I usually ask about recipes and English.","alts":["Mostly recipes and questions about English.","I ask for recipes and help with English."],"keys":[["recipe*","cook*"],["english"]],"loose":["ask*","usually","questions","recipes","english","work","code","ideas","help","translate*","write*","about"],"opts":{"o":["I usually ask to recipes and English questions.","I usually am asking recipe and English question.","I usually ask about recipes and English."],"a":2},"para":["Recipes, and stuff about English.","Cooking ideas and English help, mostly."],"tip":"「〜について尋ねる」は ask about ... です。"},
{"id":"i-tech-06","lv":2,"theme":"tech","q":"How has AI changed the way you work?","qja":"AIで働き方はどう変わりましたか?","hint":"資料作りが速くなり、考える時間が増えた","model":"I can make documents faster, so I have more time to think.","alts":["Documents take less time now, so I've got more time for thinking.","I make materials much faster, which gives me more time to think."],"keys":[["faster","quicker","less time","quickly","speed*"],["think*"]],"loose":["faster","save*","time","more","less","easier","work","help*","write*","now","changed","productive"],"opts":{"o":["I can make documents faster, so I have more time to think.","I can make documents more fast, so I have more time to think.","I can making documents faster, so time to think increases more."],"a":0},"para":["Way faster paperwork, more time to think.","It speeds things up, so I can focus on thinking."],"tip":"fast の比較級は faster です。more fast とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-tech-07","lv":2,"theme":"tech","q":"Are you worried about your privacy online?","qja":"ネット上のプライバシーが心配ですか?","hint":"少し。だからサイトごとに違うパスワードを使うようにしている","model":"A little, so I try to use a different password for everything.","alts":["A bit, so I use different passwords for each site.","Somewhat. That's why I never reuse passwords."],"keys":[["little","bit","somewhat","yes"],["password*"]],"loose":["little","bit","yes","no","worried","careful","privacy","password*","data","share","personal","not"],"opts":{"o":["A little, so I try to use a different password to everything.","A little, so I try to use a different password for everything.","A little, so I try using different passwords every things."],"a":1},"para":["Somewhat. I use unique passwords everywhere.","A bit, so I'm careful with passwords."],"tip":"try to + 動詞 で「〜するよう心がける」です。"},
{"id":"i-tech-08","lv":2,"theme":"tech","q":"Have you ever made anything with code?","qja":"プログラミングで何かを作ったことはありますか?","hint":"ある。AIに手伝ってもらって小さな学習アプリを作った","model":"Yes, I made a small study app with help from AI.","alts":["I have. I built a little learning app with AI's help.","Yes, I created a small study app using AI."],"keys":[["app*"],["ai","ais"]],"loose":["yes","no","made","built","created","app*","website","game","code","program*","never","once","small"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I made a small study app with help of AI.","Yes, I have made small studying app helping AI.","Yes, I made a small study app with help from AI."],"a":2},"para":["Yeah, a little study app, with AI doing a lot of the heavy lifting.","I built a small learning app with an AI assistant."],"tip":"「〜の助けを借りて」は with help from ... または with the help of ... です。"},
{"id":"i-tech-09","lv":2,"theme":"tech","q":"Which device couldn't you live without?","qja":"これがないと生きていけない、という機器は何ですか?","hint":"ノートパソコン。仕事も趣味も全部これ","model":"My laptop, because I use it for both work and hobbies.","alts":["My laptop. I do everything on it, work and fun.","Definitely my laptop, since I use it for work and my hobbies."],"keys":[["laptop","computer","pc"],["work"]],"loose":["phone","laptop","computer","because","use*","everything","work","without","watch","tablet","my","music"],"opts":{"o":["My laptop, because I use it for both work and hobbies.","My laptop, because I use it both work and hobbies.","My laptop, because I am using for work and hobby both."],"a":0},"para":["My laptop. It's my whole life.","Laptop, for sure. Work and play."],"tip":"both A and B で「AもBも」。use it for both work and hobbies の語順です。"},
{"id":"i-tech-10","lv":2,"theme":"tech","q":"Do you think kids should learn programming at school?","qja":"子どもは学校でプログラミングを学ぶべきだと思いますか?","hint":"思う。論理的に考える力がつくから","model":"Yes, because it helps them learn to think logically.","alts":["I think so. It teaches them to think logically.","Yes, since it builds logical thinking skills."],"keys":[["yes","yeah","definitely","sure","of course","i think so","should"],["logic*"]],"loose":["yes","no","think","should","because","logical*","future","skills","useful","important","creative","learn*"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, because it helps them learning to think logical.","Yes, because it is helping them think logic.","Yes, because it helps them learn to think logically."],"a":2},"para":["Definitely. It trains logical thinking.","Sure, it's great for building logic skills."],"tip":"help + 人 + 動詞の原形 で「人が〜するのを助ける」です。"},
{"id":"i-tech-11","lv":3,"theme":"tech","q":"Do you think AI will take away people's jobs?","qja":"AIは人の仕事を奪うと思いますか?","hint":"一部はなくなるが、新しい仕事も生まれると思う","model":"Some jobs will disappear, but I think AI will also create new kinds of work.","alts":["Some, yes, but new types of jobs will appear too.","I think some jobs will go away, although new ones will be created."],"keys":[["some"],["new"]],"loose":["think","some","jobs","new","create*","but","although","replace*","work","people","will","change*","because"],"opts":{"o":["Some jobs will disappear, but I think AI will also make new kind of works.","Some jobs will disappear, but I think AI will also create new kinds of work.","Some jobs disappear, but I think AI is creating new work kind."],"a":1},"para":["It'll replace some jobs, but create others.","Some jobs, sure, but new ones will pop up too."],"tip":"work は「仕事」の意味では数えられないので works にしません。"},
{"id":"i-tech-12","lv":3,"theme":"tech","q":"What's a piece of technology you think is overrated?","qja":"過大評価されていると思うテクノロジーは何ですか?","hint":"スマートウォッチ。結局スマホで十分だから","model":"Smartwatches, because I can do almost everything on my phone anyway.","alts":["I'd say smartwatches, since my phone already does most of that.","Smartwatches. My phone is enough for me."],"keys":[["watch*","smartwatch*"],["phone*"]],"loose":["think","overrated","because","phone","watch*","expensive","useful","need","really","anyway","vr","glasses"],"opts":{"o":["Smartwatches, because I can do almost everything on my phone anyway.","Smartwatches, because I can do almost all on my phone anyway.","Smartwatch, because almost everything I can doing on my phone."],"a":0},"para":["Smartwatches. My phone already covers it.","Honestly, smartwatches. Kind of pointless for me."],"tip":"anyway を文末に置くと「どうせ、結局」というニュアンスになります。"},
{"id":"i-tech-13","lv":3,"theme":"tech","q":"How do you check if information from AI is correct?","qja":"AIからの情報が正しいかどうか、どうやって確認していますか?","hint":"信頼できるサイトや本で、元の情報を確認する","model":"I always check the original source on a reliable website or in a book.","alts":["I look up the source on trusted websites or in books.","I double-check with reliable sites or books."],"keys":[["source*","website*","site*","book*"],["reliable","trusted","trustworthy","official","trust"]],"loose":["check*","source*","search*","compare*","website*","books","always","double","verify","google","reliable","ask"],"opts":{"o":["I always check the original source in a reliable website or by a book.","I'm always checking original source with reliable website or book.","I always check the original source on a reliable website or in a book."],"a":2},"para":["I double-check with sources I trust.","I always look it up somewhere reliable."],"tip":"double-check は「再確認する」の意味でよく使います。"},
{"id":"i-tech-14","lv":3,"theme":"tech","q":"If you could invent any gadget, what would it be?","qja":"どんなガジェットでも発明できるとしたら、何を作りますか?","hint":"どんな言語でもすぐ翻訳してくれるイヤホン","model":"I'd invent earphones that could instantly translate any language.","alts":["Earbuds that translate any language in real time.","I'd make earphones that translate every language instantly."],"keys":[["earphone*","earbud*","headphone*"],["translat*"]],"loose":["would","invent*","make","robot","machine","that","could","gadget","time","translate*","clean*","help*"],"opts":{"o":["I'd invent earphones who could translate any language instantly.","I'd invent earphones that could instantly translate any language.","I will invent earphones that translating any language soon."],"a":1},"para":["Real-time translation earbuds.","Earphones that translate anything on the spot."],"tip":"物を説明する関係代名詞は that か which。who は人に使います。"},
{"id":"i-tech-15","lv":4,"theme":"tech","q":"Some people trust AI more than human experts. Is that a good thing?","qja":"人間の専門家よりAIを信頼する人もいます。それはよいことですか?","hint":"あまりよくない。AIは間違えることもあるので、最終判断は人がすべき","model":"Not really, because AI can make mistakes, so I think humans should still make the final decision.","alts":["I don't think so, since AI can be wrong, and people should have the final say.","It's risky, because AI isn't always right, so the final call should be up to humans."],"keys":[["mistake*","wrong","not always right","error*"],["final","last"]],"loose":["think","not","because","mistakes","wrong","human*","people","experts","trust","decision","final","although","depend*","risky"],"opts":{"o":["Not really, because AI can make mistakes, so I think humans should still make the final decision.","Not really, because AI can make mistakes, so I think humans should still decide the final decision.","Not really, AI can mistake, so humans still should making final decision."],"a":0},"para":["Not really. AI makes mistakes, so humans should have the last word.","I'm wary. AI's a tool, not the final judge."],"tip":"「決定を下す」は make a decision。decide a decision とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-tech-16","lv":4,"theme":"tech","q":"How do you think technology will change daily life in ten years?","qja":"10年後、テクノロジーは日常生活をどう変えていると思いますか?","hint":"自動運転が当たり前になり、家事の多くをロボットがする","model":"I think self-driving cars will be normal, and robots will do a lot of the housework.","alts":["Self-driving cars will be common, and robots will handle most chores.","Probably, cars will drive themselves and robots will help with housework."],"keys":[["self driving","driverless","autonomous","drive themselves"],["robot*"]],"loose":["think","will","probably","cars","robots","ai","more","less","everything","work","home","change*","maybe"],"opts":{"o":["I think self-driving cars will be normal, and robots will do many of the housework.","I think self-driving car becomes normal, and robots will doing housework a lot.","I think self-driving cars will be normal, and robots will do a lot of the housework."],"a":2},"para":["Driverless cars everywhere, and robots doing chores.","Robots at home and cars that drive themselves."],"tip":"housework は数えられないので a lot of を使い、many は使いません。"},
{"id":"i-space-01","lv":1,"theme":"space","q":"Do you like looking at the stars?","qja":"星を見るのは好きですか?","hint":"はい、特に冬の夜空","model":"Yes, I love it, especially on winter nights.","alts":["Yes, especially in winter.","I really do, particularly the winter sky."],"keys":[["yes","yeah","love","like","i do","i really do"],["winter"]],"loose":["yes","no","love*","like*","stars","night","sky","especially","summer","winter","city","dark"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I love it, especially on winter nights.","Yes, I love it, especially at winter night.","Yes, I'm loving it, special winter nights."],"a":0},"para":["Love it, especially on a cold winter night.","Big fan, mostly in winter."],"tip":"night に説明が付くときは on を使います (on winter nights)。単に「夜に」なら at night です。"},
{"id":"i-space-02","lv":1,"theme":"space","q":"Have you ever seen a shooting star?","qja":"流れ星を見たことはありますか?","hint":"ある。山でキャンプしたとき","model":"Yes, I saw one when I went camping in the mountains.","alts":["Yes, once, while camping in the mountains.","I have. I saw one on a camping trip in the mountains."],"keys":[["camp*"],["mountain*"]],"loose":["yes","no","saw","seen","once","never","night","camping","mountain*","sky","shooting","star","wish"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I saw one when I went to camping in the mountains.","Yes, I have seen one when I camped mountains.","Yes, I saw one when I went camping in the mountains."],"a":2},"para":["Yeah, once while camping up in the mountains.","I did, on a mountain camping trip."],"tip":"go camping で「キャンプに行く」。go to camping とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-space-03","lv":1,"theme":"space","q":"Would you like to go to space someday?","qja":"いつか宇宙に行ってみたいですか?","hint":"はい、宇宙から地球を見てみたい","model":"Yes, I'd love to see the Earth from space.","alts":["Yes, I want to see Earth from space.","Definitely. I'd love to look at Earth from up there."],"keys":[["earth","our planet"],["see","look","view"]],"loose":["yes","no","would","love","want*","see","earth","moon","space","scary","maybe","someday","expensive"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I'd love seeing the Earth from the space.","Yes, I'd love to see the Earth from space.","Yes, I would love to see Earth by space."],"a":1},"para":["For sure. I'd love to see Earth from orbit.","Absolutely, just to see our planet from above."],"tip":"「宇宙」の space には冠詞を付けません (from space)。"},
{"id":"i-space-04","lv":1,"theme":"space","q":"Which planet do you think is the most interesting?","qja":"一番おもしろいと思う惑星はどれですか?","hint":"土星。輪がきれいだから","model":"Saturn, because its rings are so beautiful.","alts":["I think Saturn. Its rings are beautiful.","Saturn, because I love its rings."],"keys":[["saturn"],["ring*"]],"loose":["think","because","saturn","jupiter","mars","venus","earth","rings","big","red","planet","beautiful"],"opts":{"o":["Saturn, because its rings are so beautiful.","Saturn, because it's rings are so beautiful.","Saturn, because its ring is so beautifully."],"a":0},"para":["Saturn, hands down. Those rings!","Saturn, for the rings."],"tip":"「それの」は its。it's (= it is) と混同しないようにします。"},
{"id":"i-space-05","lv":1,"theme":"space","q":"Can you see many stars where you live?","qja":"住んでいるところでは星がたくさん見えますか?","hint":"あまり見えない。街が明るすぎる","model":"Not really, because the city is too bright.","alts":["Not many. The city lights are too bright.","No, it's too bright in the city."],"keys":[["not","no"],["bright","light*"]],"loose":["yes","no","not","many","city","bright","lights","dark","countryside","few","can","see"],"opts":{"o":["Not really, because the city is too much bright.","No really, because city is so bright to see.","Not really, because the city is too bright."],"a":2},"para":["Hardly any. Too much light pollution.","Not really. The city's way too bright."],"tip":"「明るすぎる」は too bright。too much bright とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-space-06","lv":2,"theme":"space","q":"Do you think there's life on other planets?","qja":"他の惑星に生命はいると思いますか?","hint":"いると思う。宇宙はとても広いから","model":"I think so, because the universe is so huge.","alts":["Probably, since the universe is incredibly big.","Yes, I believe so. Space is just too big for us to be alone."],"keys":[["think so","believe so","yes","probably","definitely","i bet"],["huge","big","large","vast","enormous"]],"loose":["think","believe","yes","no","maybe","probably","because","universe","big","huge","alone","somewhere","life"],"opts":{"o":["I think so, because the universe is so huge.","I think so, because the universe is so much huge.","I think yes, because universe is very wide."],"a":0},"para":["Probably. The universe is way too big for it to be just us.","I'd bet on it. There are so many planets out there."],"tip":"広さを言うときは wide ではなく huge や vast を使います。"},
{"id":"i-space-07","lv":2,"theme":"space","q":"What got you interested in space?","qja":"宇宙に興味を持ったきっかけは何ですか?","hint":"子どものころに見たプラネタリウム","model":"I visited a planetarium when I was a child.","alts":["A planetarium I went to as a kid.","Going to a planetarium when I was little."],"keys":[["planetarium"],["child","kid","little","young"]],"loose":["when","child","kid","young","book*","movie*","planetarium","father","school","watched","saw","because"],"opts":{"o":["I visited to a planetarium when I was child.","I was visiting a planetarium when I am a child.","I visited a planetarium when I was a child."],"a":2},"para":["A trip to the planetarium as a kid.","It all started at a planetarium when I was little."],"tip":"visit は他動詞なので visit a planetarium (to は不要) です。"},
{"id":"i-space-08","lv":2,"theme":"space","q":"Would you rather visit the Moon or Mars?","qja":"月と火星、行くならどちらがいいですか?","hint":"月。近いし、地球が見えるから","model":"The Moon, because it's closer and I could see the Earth.","alts":["I'd pick the Moon. It's nearer, and you can see Earth from there.","The Moon, since it's closer and has a great view of Earth."],"keys":[["moon"],["close*","near*","not as far","not far"]],"loose":["would","rather","moon","mars","because","closer","red","see","safe*","far","explore","both"],"opts":{"o":["The Moon, because it's more close and I could see the Earth.","The Moon, because it's closer and I could see the Earth.","The Moon, because it is near and I can seeing the Earth."],"a":1},"para":["The Moon. Closer, with an amazing view of Earth.","Moon, for sure. It's not as far."],"tip":"Would you rather A or B? は「AとBのどちらがいい?」という定番の質問です。"},
{"id":"i-space-09","lv":2,"theme":"space","q":"Have you ever used a telescope?","qja":"望遠鏡を使ったことはありますか?","hint":"ある。月のクレーターがはっきり見えた","model":"Yes, and I could see the craters on the Moon clearly.","alts":["Yes. I saw the Moon's craters really clearly.","I have, and the craters on the Moon looked so clear."],"keys":[["crater*"],["moon*"]],"loose":["yes","no","never","once","saw","moon","craters","jupiter","saturn","telescope","school","clearly"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, and I could see the craters on the Moon clearly.","Yes, and I could see the craters of the Moon clear.","Yes, and I was seeing craters in the Moon clearly."],"a":0},"para":["Yep. The Moon's craters were super sharp.","I did, and the craters blew me away."],"tip":"「はっきりと」は副詞の clearly。clear は形容詞です。"},
{"id":"i-space-10","lv":2,"theme":"space","q":"Do you follow any news about space missions?","qja":"宇宙ミッションのニュースを追いかけていますか?","hint":"ときどき。ロケットの打ち上げ動画を見る","model":"Sometimes. I like watching rocket launch videos.","alts":["Now and then. I watch videos of rocket launches.","Sometimes, mostly rocket launch videos."],"keys":[["rocket*"],["launch*"]],"loose":["sometimes","yes","no","news","watch*","videos","rocket*","launch*","online","read*","follow*","often"],"opts":{"o":["Sometimes. I like to watching rocket launch videos.","Sometimes. I like see rocket launching video.","Sometimes. I like watching rocket launch videos."],"a":2},"para":["Now and then. Rocket launches are my favorite.","Sometimes. I love a good launch video."],"tip":"like + -ing か like to + 動詞 のどちらかで「〜するのが好き」と言います。"},
{"id":"i-space-11","lv":3,"theme":"space","q":"Why do you think people are so fascinated by space?","qja":"人はなぜこれほど宇宙に惹かれるのだと思いますか?","hint":"まだわからないことが多く、自分がちっぽけに感じられるから","model":"Because there's still so much we don't know, and it makes us feel small.","alts":["There's so much mystery, and it makes us realize how small we are.","Because it's full of unknowns, and it reminds us how tiny we are."],"keys":[["know","unknown*","myster*"],["small","tiny"]],"loose":["because","think","mystery","unknown","know","small","beautiful","curious","huge","future","people","dream*","explore"],"opts":{"o":["Because there's still so much we don't know, and it makes us feel small.","Because there's still so many things we don't know, and it makes us to feel small.","Because still there is much we not know, and it makes us feeling small."],"a":0},"para":["It's the ultimate mystery, and it puts things in perspective.","So much is unknown, and it makes us feel tiny."],"tip":"make + 人 + 動詞の原形 で「人に〜させる」。make us to feel とは言いません。"},
{"id":"i-space-12","lv":3,"theme":"space","q":"If you could ask an astronaut one question, what would you ask?","qja":"宇宙飛行士に1つだけ質問できるとしたら、何を聞きますか?","hint":"宇宙から地球を見たとき、どんな気持ちだったか","model":"I'd ask how they felt when they first saw the Earth from space.","alts":["How it felt to see Earth from space for the first time.","I'd ask what they felt when they looked down at Earth."],"keys":[["felt","feel*"],["earth","our planet"]],"loose":["would","ask","how","what","felt","feel","scary","earth","sleep","eat","space","first","why"],"opts":{"o":["I'd ask how did they feel when they first saw the Earth from space.","I'll ask them how they felt when first they saw Earth in space.","I'd ask how they felt when they first saw the Earth from space."],"a":2},"para":["What it felt like seeing Earth from up there.","How it felt to look back at our planet."],"tip":"文の中の疑問(間接疑問)は how they felt のように平叙文の語順にします。"},
{"id":"i-space-13","lv":3,"theme":"space","q":"Do you think space travel will become common in our lifetime?","qja":"生きているうちに宇宙旅行は一般的になると思いますか?","hint":"ある程度は。ただ、しばらくはお金持ちだけのものだと思う","model":"To some extent, but I think it'll stay too expensive for most people for a while.","alts":["Maybe, but it'll probably be only for rich people for quite a while.","Partly, although I think it'll be very expensive for a long time."],"keys":[["expensive","pricey","pricy","rich","wealthy","cost*"],["while","long time","years","at first"]],"loose":["think","maybe","probably","expensive","rich","cheap*","future","lifetime","common","but","although","will","people"],"opts":{"o":["To some extent, but I think it'll stay too expensive for most of people for a while.","To some extent, but I think it'll stay too expensive for most people for a while.","Some extent, but I think it stays too expensive for the most people a while."],"a":1},"para":["Maybe, but it'll be pricey for a long time.","Sort of, but only the wealthy will go at first."],"tip":"「ほとんどの人」は most people (of なし) か most of the people です。"},
{"id":"i-space-14","lv":3,"theme":"space","q":"What's the best place you've ever been to for stargazing?","qja":"今までで一番星がよく見えた場所はどこですか?","hint":"沖縄の離島。天の川がはっきり見えた","model":"A small island in Okinawa, where I could clearly see the Milky Way.","alts":["An island in Okinawa. The Milky Way was so clear there.","Probably a remote island in Okinawa, because I saw the Milky Way clearly."],"keys":[["okinawa"],["milky way","galaxy"]],"loose":["best","place","island","mountain*","desert","beach","because","where","clear*","dark","stars","saw","countryside"],"opts":{"o":["A small island in Okinawa, where I could clearly see the Milky Way.","A small island in Okinawa, which I could clearly see the Milky Way.","A small island of Okinawa, I could see clearly Milky Way there it."],"a":0},"para":["A tiny island in Okinawa. The Milky Way was unreal.","Off the coast of Okinawa, on a little island."],"tip":"場所を説明する関係詞は where を使います (where I could see ...)。"},
{"id":"i-space-15","lv":4,"theme":"space","q":"Some people say space exploration is a waste of money. What do you think?","qja":"宇宙開発はお金の無駄だと言う人もいます。どう思いますか?","hint":"同意しない。宇宙の研究から生まれた技術が日常生活にも役立っているから","model":"I disagree, because a lot of technology developed for space research is now useful in our daily lives.","alts":["I don't agree. Many technologies from space research help us in everyday life.","Not at all, since space research has led to lots of technology we use every day."],"keys":[["disagree","do not agree","not at all","not think so"],["technolog*","tech","invention*"],["daily","every day","everyday"]],"loose":["disagree*","agree*","think","because","technology","research","future","money","important","useful","although","however","problems"],"opts":{"o":["I disagree, because a lot of technologies developed for space research are useful for our daily live.","I'm disagree, because many technology for space research is now useful our daily lives.","I disagree, because a lot of technology developed for space research is now useful in our daily lives."],"a":2},"para":["Not at all. Space research gives us tech we use every day.","I'd push back on that. We all benefit from space tech."],"tip":"developed for ... は過去分詞で前の名詞を説明する形 (〜のために開発された) です。"},
{"id":"i-space-16","lv":4,"theme":"space","q":"If humans could live on another planet, would you move there?","qja":"もし人類が他の惑星に住めるとしたら、移住しますか?","hint":"しないと思う。家族や友だちと離れるのはつらいから","model":"Probably not, because it would be too hard to leave my family and friends behind.","alts":["I don't think so. Leaving my family and friends would be too hard.","Probably not, since I couldn't stand being so far from my family and friends."],"keys":[["not","no"],["family","friends"]],"loose":["would","not","probably","yes","no","because","family","friends","earth","adventure","exciting","leave","scared","maybe"],"opts":{"o":["Probably not, because it would be too hard to leave my family and friends behind.","Probably not, because it would be too hard to leave my family and friends behind of me.","Probably no, because it is too hard leaving behind my family and friend."],"a":0},"para":["Nah. I couldn't leave my family and friends.","I'd pass. Earth is home."],"tip":"leave ... behind で「〜を残して去る」という意味になります。"},
{"id":"i-science-01","lv":1,"theme":"science","q":"Did you like science at school?","qja":"学校で理科は好きでしたか?","hint":"はい、特に実験が好きだった","model":"Yes, I especially liked doing experiments.","alts":["Yes, I loved the experiments.","I did. Experiments were my favorite part."],"keys":[["yes","yeah","i did","liked","loved"],["experiment*"]],"loose":["yes","no","liked","loved","hated","science","experiments","math","physics","chemistry","biology","teacher","favorite"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I especially liked to doing experiments.","Yes, I was especially like experiments.","Yes, I especially liked doing experiments."],"a":2},"para":["Loved it, mostly for the experiments.","Yeah, experiments were the best."],"tip":"過去の好みなので liked と過去形にします。"},
{"id":"i-science-02","lv":1,"theme":"science","q":"What science topic do you find interesting?","qja":"どんな科学の話題がおもしろいと思いますか?","hint":"人間の脳のしくみ","model":"I find the human brain really interesting.","alts":["How the human brain works. It's fascinating.","The brain. It's so interesting."],"keys":[["brain*"],["interest*","fascinat*","amazing","cool"]],"loose":["find","interesting","brain","body","animals","space","weather","dinosaur*","ocean","energy","because","how"],"opts":{"o":["I find the human brain really interesting.","I find the human brain really interested.","I am interesting in human brain."],"a":0},"para":["The brain fascinates me.","How our brains work, for sure."],"tip":"「(物事が)おもしろい」は interesting、「(人が)興味がある」は interested です。"},
{"id":"i-science-03","lv":1,"theme":"science","q":"Do you watch science videos online?","qja":"ネットで科学の動画を見ますか?","hint":"はい、寝る前によく見る","model":"Yes, I often watch them before bed.","alts":["Yes, I often watch them before I go to sleep.","I do, usually before bed."],"keys":[["bed","sleep"],["before"]],"loose":["yes","no","often","watch*","videos","sometimes","before","bed","weekend*","channel*","every","night"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I often watch them before the bed.","Yes, I often watch them before bed.","Yes, I watch often them before sleeping."],"a":1},"para":["All the time, right before bed.","Yeah, they're my bedtime routine."],"tip":"often は一般動詞の前に置きます (I often watch)。"},
{"id":"i-science-04","lv":1,"theme":"science","q":"Do you like visiting science museums?","qja":"科学館に行くのは好きですか?","hint":"はい、恐竜の展示が大好き","model":"Yes, I love the dinosaur exhibits.","alts":["Yes, especially the dinosaur sections.","I do. The dinosaurs are my favorite."],"keys":[["yes","i do","love"],["dinosaur*"]],"loose":["yes","no","love*","like*","museum*","dinosaur*","exhibits","kids","weekend","sometimes","space","robot*"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I love the dinosaur exhibits.","Yes, I love the dinosaurs exhibit.","Yes, I'm loving dinosaur exhibits."],"a":0},"para":["Love them, especially the dinosaurs.","Big yes. Dinosaurs never get old."],"tip":"名詞を形容詞のように使うときは単数形 (dinosaur exhibits) にします。"},
{"id":"i-science-05","lv":1,"theme":"science","q":"Are you good at math?","qja":"数学は得意ですか?","hint":"あまり得意ではないけど、好き","model":"Not really, but I like it.","alts":["Not very good, but I enjoy it.","I'm not great at it, but I like it."],"keys":[["not"],["like","enjoy","love","fun","interesting"]],"loose":["yes","no","not","good","bad","like","hate","math","numbers","really","school","enjoy"],"opts":{"o":["Not really, but I am liking it.","No really, but I like.","Not really, but I like it."],"a":2},"para":["Not really, but it's fun.","I'm no math whiz, but I enjoy it."],"tip":"like は目的語が必要なので I like it と言います。"},
{"id":"i-science-06","lv":2,"theme":"science","q":"What's a scientific fact that surprised you?","qja":"驚いた科学の事実は何ですか?","hint":"体の細胞の多くは数年で入れ替わるということ","model":"I was surprised that many of the cells in our body are replaced every few years.","alts":["That a lot of our body's cells get replaced every few years.","I was shocked to learn our cells keep getting replaced."],"keys":[["cell*"],["replac*","renew*","chang*","swap*"]],"loose":["surprised","that","learned","body","cells","brain","animals","water","light","because","know","fact"],"opts":{"o":["I was surprised that many of the cells in our body replace every few years.","I was surprised that many of the cells in our body are replaced every few years.","I surprised that many cells in body are replaced every few year."],"a":1},"para":["Our cells keep getting replaced. Wild, right?","Most of our cells are swapped out over the years."],"tip":"「驚いた」は I was surprised。I surprised では「驚かせた」になります。"},
{"id":"i-science-07","lv":2,"theme":"science","q":"Do you have any experiments you'd like to try at home?","qja":"家でやってみたい実験はありますか?","hint":"重曹とお酢で小さな火山を作ってみたい","model":"I'd like to make a small volcano with baking soda and vinegar.","alts":["Making a mini volcano with baking soda and vinegar.","I want to try the baking soda and vinegar volcano."],"keys":[["volcano*"],["baking soda","vinegar"]],"loose":["would","like","want*","try","make","experiment*","home","kitchen","kids","water","volcano","egg*","ice","plants"],"opts":{"o":["I'd like to make a small volcano with baking soda and vinegar.","I'd like to make a small volcano by baking soda and vinegar.","I would like making small volcano with baking soda and a vinegar."],"a":0},"para":["The classic baking soda volcano.","I'd love to do a fizzy volcano with my kids."],"tip":"材料を表す「〜で(作る)」は with を使います。"},
{"id":"i-science-08","lv":2,"theme":"science","q":"How do you explain science to children?","qja":"子どもに科学をどう説明していますか?","hint":"身近なものを例にして、一緒に実験する","model":"I use everyday things as examples and do experiments together.","alts":["I give examples from daily life, and we try experiments together.","I use familiar things and we experiment together."],"keys":[["example*","everyday","daily","familiar"],["experiment*"],["together"]],"loose":["use*","examples","simple","easy","show*","together","games","pictures","experiment*","explain*","questions","words"],"opts":{"o":["I use everyday things as example and doing experiments together.","I am using every day things to examples and experiments together.","I use everyday things as examples and do experiments together."],"a":2},"para":["Simple examples and hands-on experiments.","I keep it real-life and we try stuff together."],"tip":"everyday (形容詞) は「日常の」、every day (副詞) は「毎日」です。"},
{"id":"i-science-09","lv":2,"theme":"science","q":"Which invention do you think changed the world the most?","qja":"世界を一番変えた発明は何だと思いますか?","hint":"インターネット。世界中の人がつながったから","model":"The internet, because it connected people all over the world.","alts":["I'd say the internet, since it links people everywhere.","The internet. It connected the whole world."],"keys":[["internet","web"],["connect*","link*","together"]],"loose":["think","because","internet","electricity","printing","phone","car*","computer*","world","people","changed","medicine","wheel"],"opts":{"o":["The internet, because it connected the people all over world.","The internet, because it connected people all over the world.","The internet, because it was connecting people in all over the world."],"a":1},"para":["The internet. It brought everyone together.","Has to be the internet."],"tip":"「世界中の」は all over the world です。"},
{"id":"i-science-10","lv":2,"theme":"science","q":"Do you read about health and the human body?","qja":"健康や人の体についての本や記事を読みますか?","hint":"はい、睡眠についての記事をよく読む","model":"Yes, I often read articles about sleep.","alts":["Yes, mostly articles about sleep.","I do. I read a lot about sleep."],"keys":[["sleep*"],["read*","article*","yes","yeah","i do"]],"loose":["yes","no","read*","articles","books","sleep","food","diet","exercise","health","often","sometimes"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I often read articles about sleep.","Yes, I often read articles about sleeping well things.","Yes, I am often reading article about sleep."],"a":0},"para":["Yeah, mainly stuff about sleep.","All the time, especially sleep science."],"tip":"article は数えられる名詞なので articles と複数形にします。"},
{"id":"i-science-11","lv":3,"theme":"science","q":"If you could be a scientist, what would you research?","qja":"もし科学者になれるとしたら、何を研究しますか?","hint":"海の生き物。深海にはまだ知られていない生物が多いから","model":"I'd study deep-sea creatures, because there are still many species we haven't discovered.","alts":["Ocean life, since lots of deep-sea species haven't been found yet.","I'd research the deep sea, because so many creatures there are still unknown."],"keys":[["sea","ocean","marine"],["discover*","found","unknown","new","undiscovered","unexplored"]],"loose":["would","study","research*","because","ocean","space","brain","animals","energy","disease*","climate","since","medicine"],"opts":{"o":["I'd study deep-sea creatures, because there are still many species we didn't discover.","I will study deep sea creature, because still many species not discovered by us.","I'd study deep-sea creatures, because there are still many species we haven't discovered."],"a":2},"para":["The deep ocean. It's basically unexplored.","Deep-sea life. There's so much still out there."],"tip":"「まだ〜していない」は現在完了 we haven't discovered で表します。"},
{"id":"i-science-12","lv":3,"theme":"science","q":"What do you think is the biggest challenge for science today?","qja":"今の科学にとって一番の課題は何だと思いますか?","hint":"気候変動。解決にはみんなの協力が必要","model":"Climate change, because we can't solve it unless everyone works together.","alts":["I think climate change, and it needs everyone's cooperation.","Climate change. It can only be solved if we all work together."],"keys":[["climate","global warming"],["together","cooperat*","everyone","all of us","we all"]],"loose":["think","climate","change","energy","disease*","because","together","world","problem","solve","unless","health","future"],"opts":{"o":["Climate change, because we can't solve it unless everyone works together.","Climate change, because we can't solve it unless everyone doesn't work together.","Climate change, because we can't solving unless all people work together."],"a":0},"para":["Climate change. Nobody can fix it alone.","Global warming, and it'll take all of us."],"tip":"unless は「〜しない限り」。後ろに否定語を重ねないようにします。"},
{"id":"i-science-13","lv":3,"theme":"science","q":"Have you ever changed a habit because of something you learned?","qja":"何かを学んだことがきっかけで習慣を変えたことはありますか?","hint":"ある。寝る前のスマホが睡眠に悪いと知って、やめた","model":"Yes, I stopped using my phone before bed after learning it affects sleep.","alts":["Yes. When I learned screens hurt sleep, I quit using my phone at night.","I have. I don't look at my phone before bed anymore, since it's bad for sleep."],"keys":[["phone*","screen*"],["sleep*","bed"],["stop*","quit","not","anymore","no more","ditch*","gave up"]],"loose":["yes","stopped","started","quit","learned","because","habit","now","after","healthy","sleep","food","since"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I stopped to use my phone before bed after learning it affects sleep.","Yes, I stopped using my phone before bed after learning it affects sleep.","Yes, I am stopped using phone before bed after I learn it affects sleep."],"a":1},"para":["Yep, no more phone in bed. It wrecks your sleep.","I ditched late-night scrolling once I learned what it does to sleep."],"tip":"stop -ing は「〜するのをやめる」、stop to do は「〜するために立ち止まる」です。"},
{"id":"i-science-14","lv":3,"theme":"science","q":"Which would you rather explore, the deep sea or outer space?","qja":"深海と宇宙、探検するならどちらがいいですか?","hint":"深海。宇宙より近いのに、ほとんど知られていないから","model":"The deep sea, because even though it's closer than space, we know very little about it.","alts":["The deep sea. It's close to us, but we hardly know anything about it.","I'd pick the deep ocean, since it's so near and still mostly unknown."],"keys":[["sea","ocean"],["little","hardly","barely","unknown","not know","myster*"]],"loose":["would","rather","deep","sea","ocean","space","because","since","although","explore","scary","unknown","both"],"opts":{"o":["The deep sea, because even though it's closer than space, we know very little about it.","The deep sea, because even it's closer than space, we know very few about it.","The deep sea, because although closer than space, we are knowing little."],"a":0},"para":["The deep sea. It's right here, and we barely know it.","Ocean, for sure. It's a mystery next door."],"tip":"even though は「〜なのに」。even だけでは接続詞になりません。"},
{"id":"i-science-15","lv":4,"theme":"science","q":"Do you think science can answer every question about life?","qja":"科学は人生のあらゆる疑問に答えられると思いますか?","hint":"そうは思わない。科学は多くを説明できるが、生きる意味のような問いは別","model":"I don't think so, because although science explains a lot, questions like the meaning of life are different.","alts":["No. Science can explain many things, but not things like why we're here.","Not every question. The meaning of life is something science can't really answer."],"keys":[["not","no"],["meaning","why we are here","purpose"]],"loose":["think","not","because","although","however","science","explain*","meaning","everything","some","questions","life","maybe"],"opts":{"o":["I don't think so, because although science explains a lot, but questions like meaning of life are different.","I don't think, because science is explaining many, questions like life meaning is different.","I don't think so, because although science explains a lot, questions like the meaning of life are different."],"a":2},"para":["Not everything. Some questions are more philosophical.","Science covers a lot, but not the meaning of life."],"tip":"although と but は一緒に使いません。どちらか1つにします。"},
{"id":"i-science-16","lv":4,"theme":"science","q":"If you could ask a famous scientist from history one question, what would it be?","qja":"歴史上の有名な科学者に1つ質問できるとしたら、何を聞きますか?","hint":"失敗が続いたとき、どうやってやる気を保ったのか","model":"I'd ask how they stayed motivated when their experiments kept failing.","alts":["How they kept going after so many failed experiments.","I'd want to know how they stayed motivated through all their failures."],"keys":[["motivat*","kept going","keep going","give up","gave up","kept them going","keep trying","kept trying"],["fail*"]],"loose":["would","ask","how","why","what","idea*","failure*","motivated","discover*","think","work","future","if"],"opts":{"o":["I'd ask how they stayed motivated when their experiments kept failing.","I'd ask how did they stay motivated when their experiments kept failing.","I'd ask how they stayed motivated when their experiments were keep failing."],"a":0},"para":["How they didn't give up after all those failures.","What kept them going when nothing worked."],"tip":"keep -ing で「〜し続ける」(kept failing = 失敗し続けた) です。"},
{"id":"i-music-01","lv":1,"theme":"music","q":"What kind of music do you like?","qja":"どんな音楽が好きですか?","hint":"ロック、特に古いロック","model":"I like rock music, especially old rock.","alts":["Rock, especially the old stuff.","I love rock, particularly classic rock."],"keys":[["rock"],["old","classic"]],"loose":["like*","love*","rock","pop","jazz","classical","especially","music","listen*","hip","metal","all"],"opts":{"o":["I like rock music, especially old rocks.","I like rock music, especially old rock.","I'm like rock musics, special old rock."],"a":1},"para":["Rock, mostly the classic stuff.","Old-school rock all the way."],"tip":"ジャンル名の music は数えられないので musics にはしません。"},
{"id":"i-music-02","lv":1,"theme":"music","q":"Do you play any instruments?","qja":"何か楽器を弾きますか?","hint":"エレキギターを弾く","model":"Yes, I play the electric guitar.","alts":["I play electric guitar.","Yes, electric guitar."],"keys":[["electric"],["guitar*"]],"loose":["yes","no","play*","guitar","piano","drums","bass","violin","little","used","learn*","instrument*"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I play the electric guitar.","Yes, I play electric guitar instrument.","Yes, I am playing an electric guitar always."],"a":0},"para":["Yep, electric guitar.","I'm a guitar guy. Electric."],"tip":"楽器を弾くは play the guitar のように the を付けるのが基本です。"},
{"id":"i-music-03","lv":1,"theme":"music","q":"How often do you practice the guitar?","qja":"どのくらいギターの練習をしますか?","hint":"毎日30分","model":"I practice for thirty minutes every day.","alts":["Thirty minutes a day.","Every day, for about half an hour."],"keys":[["thirty","half an hour","30"],["every day","a day","daily"]],"loose":["every","day","minutes","hour*","week","practice*","night","weekend*","often","sometimes","usually","about"],"opts":{"o":["I practice thirty minutes in every day.","I am practicing for thirty minute every day.","I practice for thirty minutes every day."],"a":2},"para":["Half an hour, every day.","Thirty minutes a day, no matter what."],"tip":"every day の前に in は付けません。"},
{"id":"i-music-04","lv":1,"theme":"music","q":"When do you usually listen to music?","qja":"たいていいつ音楽を聴きますか?","hint":"通勤中と料理しているとき","model":"I listen to music on my commute and while I cook.","alts":["On my way to work and when I'm cooking.","While commuting and while cooking."],"keys":[["commut*","way to work","train","work"],["cook*","kitchen"]],"loose":["listen*","when","while","commute*","train","work","cook*","run*","study*","morning","night","always"],"opts":{"o":["I listen to music on my commute and while I cook.","I listen music on my commute and while I cook.","I listen to music in my commute and when cooking it."],"a":0},"para":["Commuting and cooking, mostly.","Whenever I'm on the train or in the kitchen."],"tip":"listen は listen to music のように to が必要です。"},
{"id":"i-music-05","lv":1,"theme":"music","q":"Have you ever been to a concert?","qja":"コンサートに行ったことはありますか?","hint":"ある。去年、友だちとロックのライブに行った","model":"Yes, I went to a rock concert with friends last year.","alts":["Yes, I saw a rock show with my friends last year.","I have. Last year, I went to a rock concert with my friends."],"keys":[["rock"],["last year"]],"loose":["yes","no","went","been","concert*","festival*","last","year","friends","once","never","live"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, I have gone to a rock concert with friends last year.","Yes, I went to a rock concert with friends last year.","Yes, I went to rock concert with friends in last year."],"a":1},"para":["Yep, a rock show last year with friends.","I did, last year. It was a blast."],"tip":"last year のような過去の時を示す語があるときは現在完了ではなく過去形を使います。"},
{"id":"i-music-06","lv":2,"theme":"music","q":"What made you start playing the guitar?","qja":"ギターを始めたきっかけは何ですか?","hint":"高校のとき、好きなバンドのギタリストにあこがれた","model":"In high school, I wanted to be like the guitarist in my favorite band.","alts":["I looked up to a guitarist in a band I loved in high school.","When I was in high school, I admired the guitarist of my favorite band."],"keys":[["high school"],["guitarist","guitar player"]],"loose":["because","when","school","band","friend*","father","wanted","cool","saw","heard","started","song*","video*"],"opts":{"o":["In high school, I wanted to be the guitarist like my favorite band.","When high school, I wanted being like guitarist of my favorite band.","In high school, I wanted to be like the guitarist in my favorite band."],"a":2},"para":["A guitar hero from my favorite band, back in high school.","I wanted to be like my favorite band's guitarist."],"tip":"look up to ... は「〜にあこがれる、尊敬する」の意味です。"},
{"id":"i-music-07","lv":2,"theme":"music","q":"What's the hardest part of learning the guitar?","qja":"ギターを習うときに一番難しいのはどこですか?","hint":"コードをすばやく切り替えること","model":"Changing chords quickly is the hardest part for me.","alts":["Switching between chords fast.","For me, it's changing chords smoothly and quickly."],"keys":[["chord*"],["chang*","switch*"]],"loose":["hard*","difficult","chords","fingers","practice","time*","rhythm","barre","because","fast","quickly","hurt*"],"opts":{"o":["Changing chords quickly is the hardest part for me.","Change chords quickly is the hardest part for me.","Changing chords quick is the most hard part for me."],"a":0},"para":["Switching chords fast enough.","Smooth chord changes, by far."],"tip":"主語に動詞を使うときは -ing 形 (Changing chords ...) にします。"},
{"id":"i-music-08","lv":2,"theme":"music","q":"Do you prefer playing alone or in a band?","qja":"一人で弾くのとバンドで弾くの、どちらが好きですか?","hint":"バンド。みんなで音を合わせるのが楽しい","model":"In a band, because playing together with others is so much fun.","alts":["A band. Making music with other people is really fun.","I prefer a band, since jamming together is fun."],"keys":[["band"],["fun","enjoy*","love","jam*","together"]],"loose":["prefer*","alone","band","because","fun","together","others","both","home","people","jam*","nervous"],"opts":{"o":["In a band, because playing together with others are so much fun.","In a band, because playing together with others is so much fun.","In a band, because play together with others is so funny."],"a":1},"para":["A band, for sure. Jamming is the best.","With others. It's way more fun."],"tip":"「楽しい」は fun。funny は「おかしい、笑える」です。"},
{"id":"i-music-09","lv":2,"theme":"music","q":"Is there a song that always cheers you up?","qja":"いつも元気をくれる曲はありますか?","hint":"ある。昔のロックの曲で、聴くと踊りたくなる","model":"Yes, an old rock song that always makes me want to dance.","alts":["Yes, there's an old rock song that makes me want to dance.","There is. A classic rock tune that gets me dancing."],"keys":[["rock"],["dance","dancing"]],"loose":["yes","song","always","makes","happy","when","favorite","listen*","sad","cheer*","feel*","dance"],"opts":{"o":["Yes, an old rock song that always makes me want to dance.","Yes, an old rock song that always makes me to want dance.","Yes, an old rock song always make me wanting to dance."],"a":0},"para":["Yep, an old rock song that gets me dancing every time.","There's this classic rock track I can't sit still to."],"tip":"make + 人 + 動詞の原形 (makes me want to dance) の形に注意します。"},
{"id":"i-music-10","lv":2,"theme":"music","q":"How do you learn new songs on the guitar?","qja":"ギターで新しい曲をどうやって覚えていますか?","hint":"動画を見て、ゆっくり少しずつ練習する","model":"I watch videos and practice slowly, little by little.","alts":["I learn from videos and practice slowly, bit by bit.","I watch online lessons and go slowly, one part at a time."],"keys":[["video*","lesson*","tutorial*"],["slow*"]],"loose":["watch*","videos","tabs","ear","practice*","slowly","listen*","lesson*","part*","sheet","music","online","learn*"],"opts":{"o":["I watch videos and practice slow, little and little.","I watch video and practicing slowly, a little by a little.","I watch videos and practice slowly, little by little."],"a":2},"para":["Videos and lots of slow practice.","Online tutorials, nice and slow."],"tip":"little by little は「少しずつ」という決まった言い方です。"},
{"id":"i-music-11","lv":3,"theme":"music","q":"How has playing music changed your life?","qja":"音楽を演奏することで人生はどう変わりましたか?","hint":"ストレスを発散できるようになり、新しい友だちもできた","model":"It's helped me relieve stress, and I've made a lot of new friends through it.","alts":["It's a great way to deal with stress, and I've met many friends through music.","Playing music lets me release stress, and I've made new friends thanks to it."],"keys":[["stress*"],["friend*"]],"loose":["helped","stress","friends","happy","confidence","relax*","because","made","met","life","changed","more","through"],"opts":{"o":["It's helped me relieve stress, and I've made a lot of new friends through it.","It's helped me to relieve stress, and I've made a lot of new friend through it.","It is helping me relieve stress, and I made many new friend with it."],"a":0},"para":["It's my stress relief, and it's brought me great friends.","Less stress, more friends."],"tip":"「友だちができる」は make friends と言います。"},
{"id":"i-music-12","lv":3,"theme":"music","q":"If you could play with any musician, who would you choose?","qja":"どんなミュージシャンとでも共演できるとしたら、誰を選びますか?","hint":"昔の伝説的なブルースのギタリスト。その演奏を近くで感じたいから","model":"I'd choose a legendary blues guitarist, because I'd love to feel their playing up close.","alts":["Some legendary blues guitarist, since I'd want to hear them play right next to me.","A blues guitar legend. I'd love to watch them play up close."],"keys":[["blues"],["guitar*"]],"loose":["would","choose","because","guitarist","singer","band","legend*","favorite","play","learn","love","since"],"opts":{"o":["I'd choose a legendary blues guitarist, because I'd love to feel their playing close up to.","I'd choose a legendary blues guitarist, because I'd love to feel their playing up close.","I would choose legend blues guitarist, because I love feeling their play near."],"a":1},"para":["A blues legend, just to watch them up close.","Some old blues master. That'd be a dream."],"tip":"up close は「すぐ近くで」という口語的な表現です。"},
{"id":"i-music-13","lv":3,"theme":"music","q":"Do you think anyone can learn an instrument as an adult?","qja":"大人になってからでも誰でも楽器を習得できると思いますか?","hint":"できると思う。毎日少しでも続ければ上達する","model":"I think so, because if you practice a little every day, you'll definitely improve.","alts":["Yes, as long as you practice a bit each day, you'll get better.","Definitely. If you keep practicing daily, you'll improve."],"keys":[["practice*","practicing"],["improv*","better"]],"loose":["think","yes","anyone","because","practice*","every","day","age","never","late","improve*","if","patient"],"opts":{"o":["I think so, because if you will practice a little every day, you'll definitely improve.","I think so, because if you practice little every days, you definitely improving.","I think so, because if you practice a little every day, you'll definitely improve."],"a":2},"para":["Totally. A little practice every day goes a long way.","It's never too late if you stick with it."],"tip":"if の節では未来のことでも現在形 (if you practice) を使います。"},
{"id":"i-music-14","lv":3,"theme":"music","q":"What would you say to someone who wants to quit the guitar?","qja":"ギターをやめたいという人に、何と言いますか?","hint":"簡単な好きな曲を1つ弾けるようにしてみて、と言う","model":"I'd tell them to try learning one easy song they love before giving up.","alts":["Learn one simple song you really like before you quit.","I'd suggest picking one easy favorite song and learning it first."],"keys":[["easy","simple"],["song*"]],"loose":["would","tell","say","keep","try","practice","give","up","quit","slowly","song","fun","enjoy","because"],"opts":{"o":["I'd tell them to try learning one easy song they love before giving up.","I'd tell them trying to learn one easy song they love before give up.","I would say them to learn one easy song they love before they will give up."],"a":0},"para":["Find one easy song you love and nail it first.","Don't quit yet. Learn one fun song and see how it feels."],"tip":"前置詞 before の後ろは -ing 形 (before giving up) にできます。"},
{"id":"i-music-15","lv":4,"theme":"music","q":"Some people say music today isn't as good as it used to be. Do you agree?","qja":"今の音楽は昔ほどよくないと言う人もいます。同意しますか?","hint":"同意しない。スタイルが変わっただけで、今もいい音楽はたくさんある","model":"I don't agree, because the styles have just changed, and there's still plenty of great music out there.","alts":["Not really. Styles have changed, but there's still lots of good music.","I disagree, since it's just a different style, and great music is still being made."],"keys":[["not agree","disagree","not really"],["style*","different"],["still"]],"loose":["agree*","disagree*","think","because","different","styles","changed","still","good","great","old","new","although","depend*"],"opts":{"o":["I don't agree, because the styles have just changed, and there's still many great musics out there.","I don't agree, because the styles have just changed, and there's still plenty of great music out there.","I'm not agree, because styles just change, and still there is many good music."],"a":1},"para":["Nah. It's just different, and there's still tons of good stuff.","I'd disagree. Great music never stopped coming out."],"tip":"plenty of は「たくさんの」で、数えられない名詞にも使えます。"},
{"id":"i-music-16","lv":4,"theme":"music","q":"Would you rather give up listening to music or playing it?","qja":"音楽を聴くことと演奏すること、あきらめるならどちらですか?","hint":"演奏をあきらめる。聴くことは生活の一部で、なくてはならないから","model":"I'd give up playing, because listening to music is part of my everyday life and I can't live without it.","alts":["Playing, I guess, since listening is something I do every day and couldn't live without.","I'd stop playing, because I need music in my daily life more than anything."],"keys":[["playing"],["every day","everyday","daily","without it","without"]],"loose":["would","give","up","playing","listening","because","choose","since","life","without","tough","hard","both"],"opts":{"o":["I'd give up playing, because listening to music is part of my every day life and I can't live without.","I'd give up to play, because listening music is part of my life and can't live without it.","I'd give up playing, because listening to music is part of my everyday life and I can't live without it."],"a":2},"para":["Tough one, but I'd give up playing. I can't live without listening.","Playing, I suppose. Music in my ears is non-negotiable."],"tip":"give up の後ろは -ing 形 (give up playing) です。"}
